       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"23243\" data-output-id=\"32\" data-out-n=\"273\" data-sub-idx=\"6\" data-output-format=\"SVG\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"12\" data-sub-start=\"14\" data-sub-end=\"14\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[273]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\\\Users\\\\Bob Lansdorp\\\\Documents\\\\DCT\\\\img\\\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\\\wl_1r6xnba9bsvi.svg\" width=\"587\" height=\"400\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_1r6xnba9bsvi.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* Kramers-Kronig-valid lower bound for every file, using the threshold from params *)\nkkMins = Map[First[DCTKKCheck`KKValidFreqRange[#, kkResidualThreshold]] &, kkAllResults];\n\n(* Percentile table: inspect before accepting the automatic fMinHz *)\nPrint[Style[\"Lin-KK fMin distribution (threshold = \" <> ToString[100 kkResidualThreshold] <> \"%):\", Bold, 13]];\nPrint[Grid[\n  Prepend[\n    {ToString[#] <> \"th\", NumberForm[Quantile[kkMins, #/100.], {5,3}]} & /@ {0, 25, 50, 75, 90, 95, 100},\n    {Style[\"Percentile\", Bold], Style[\"fMin (Hz)\", Bold]}\n  ],\n  Frame -> All, Alignment -> {Right, Center}, Spacings -> {2, 0.8}\n]];\n\n(* Histogram of the per-file valid lower bound; outliers show up as a long right tail *)\nDCTPlots`PlotKKFMinHistogram[kkMins]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
