  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 1.3 Set fMinHz",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Set fMinHz from the population percentile defined in params.\n   If the histogram shows a long right tail (outlier files), lower kkFMinPercentile\n   or investigate those files individually. *)\nfMinHz = Quantile[kkMins, kkFMinPercentile / 100.];\n\nPrint[\"fMinHz \\[LeftArrow] \", NumberForm[fMinHz, {5,3}], \" Hz  \",\n      \"(\", kkFMinPercentile, \"th percentile of \", Length[kkMins], \" files)\"]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><span class=\"wl-ps\">fMinHz ← </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"64\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7Mi41MTJ9\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">2.512</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> Hz  </span><span class=\"wl-ps\">(</span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"64\" data-latex-b64=\"NTA=\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span></div><span class=\"wl-ps\">th percentile of </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"64\" data-latex-b64=\"NDU4\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">458</span></span></span></span></span></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> files)</span></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: fMinHz ←[formula] Hz([formula]th percentile of[formula] files)",
       "mime": "text/plain"
