      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* Residuals for ALL fits overlaid (semi-transparent), with reference lines at\n   5% amplitude and 3\\[Degree] phase \\[Dash] supports the reconstruction-accuracy claim (Fig. Sx).\n   Pass a single spec instead, e.g. goodSpecs[[15, \"Spec\"]], for one spectrum. *)\nDCTPlots`PlotResiduals[goodSpecs[[All, \"Spec\"]]]",
