  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 4a.8 Mode capacitance vs time\nIntegrated g(k) capacitance inside the slow (unfolded, range 1) and fast (folded, range 2) `kPeakRanges` windows over the 24 h drift run, one trace per electrode. Placed after 4a.6 because it needs `kPeakRanges`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* 4a.8  Capacitance of each mode vs time: the integrated g(k) area inside the slow\n   (unfolded, range 1) and fast (folded, range 2) kPeakRanges windows, one trace per\n   electrode. Same trapezoid integration over log10 k as the fraction-folded analysis\n   in 5.4, defined locally here so this cell runs before section 5. Theme-aware. *)\nmodeCap[spec_, {kLo_, kHi_}] := Module[{k = 1./spec[\"Tau\"], g = spec[\"g\"], logK, n},\n  logK = Log10[k]; n = Length[g];\n  If[n < 2, Return[0.]];\n  Total @ Table[If[kLo <= 0.5 (k[[j]] + k[[j + 1]]) <= kHi,\n    0.5 (g[[j]] + g[[j + 1]]) Abs[logK[[j + 1]] - logK[[j]]], 0.], {j, n - 1}]];\n\ndriftElectrodes = Sort @ DeleteDuplicates[electrodeOf[#File] & /@ goodSpecs];\ndriftGroups     = GroupBy[goodSpecs, electrodeOf[#File] &];\neColsDrift      = ColorData[97] /@ Range[Length[driftElectrodes]];\n\n(* {time h, capacitance nF} traces, one per electrode, for window wi (1 = slow, 2 = fast),\n   each spectrum integrated over its OWN gap-centred window (peakWindows, 4a.6) *)\ncapTraces[wi_] := Table[\n  SortBy[{#Spec[\"FinishTimeS\"]/3600., 1.*^9 modeCap[#Spec, peakWindows[#Spec][[wi]]]} & /@ driftGroups[e], First],\n  {e, driftElectrodes}];\n\ncapPanel[wi_, ttl_] := Module[{fg, bg, traces, allPts, tHi, yHi},\n  fg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White];\n  bg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", White, GrayLevel[0.12]];\n  traces = capTraces[wi]; allPts = Flatten[traces, 1];\n  tHi = Max[allPts[[All, 1]]]; yHi = 1.05 Max[allPts[[All, 2]]];\n  ListLinePlot[traces, Joined -> True, PlotMarkers -> {Automatic, 6},\n    PlotStyle -> (Directive[#, AbsoluteThickness[1.8]] & /@ eColsDrift),\n    PlotTheme -> \"Default\", Frame -> True, Axes -> False, Background -> bg,\n    FrameStyle -> Directive[fg, AbsoluteThickness[1.1]],\n    FrameTicks -> {{DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[0., yHi, fg], None}, {DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[0., tHi, fg], None}},\n    FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[fg, 12], LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 13, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"],\n    FrameLabel -> {Style[\"Time (hours)\", 14, fg], Style[\"Capacitance (nF)\", 14, fg]},\n    PlotLabel -> Style[ttl, 13, fg, Bold],\n    PlotRange -> {{0, tHi}, {0, yHi}}, PlotRangePadding -> Scaled[0.04],\n    PlotLegends -> Placed[LineLegend[eColsDrift, DCTPlots`ElectrodeName /@ driftElectrodes, LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 12]], Right],\n    ImageSize -> 480, AspectRatio -> 0.7]];\n\nRow[{capPanel[1, \"Slow mode (unfolded), 10 /s to gap centre\"],\n     Spacer[10],\n     capPanel[2, \"Fast mode (folded), gap centre to 500 /s\"]}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"23243\" data-output-id=\"48\" data-out-n=\"353\" data-sub-idx=\"8\" data-output-format=\"SVG\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"63\" data-sub-start=\"37\" data-sub-end=\"39\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[353]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\\\Users\\\\Bob Lansdorp\\\\Documents\\\\DCT\\\\img\\\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\\\wl_1cpnh1r6bj086.svg\" width=\"805\" height=\"1007\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_1cpnh1r6bj086.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* 4a.8  Capacitance of each mode vs time: the integrated g(k) area inside the slow\n   (unfolded, range 1) and fast (folded, range 2) kPeakRanges windows, one trace per\n   electrode. Same trapezoid integration over log10 k as the fraction-folded analysis\n   in 5.4, defined locally here so this cell runs before section 5. Theme-aware. *)\nmodeCap[spec_, {kLo_, kHi_}] := Module[{k = 1./spec[\"Tau\"], g = spec[\"g\"], logK, n},\n  logK = Log10[k]; n = Length[g];\n  If[n < 2, Return[0.]];\n  Total @ Table[If[kLo <= 0.5 (k[[j]] + k[[j + 1]]) <= kHi,\n    0.5 (g[[j]] + g[[j + 1]]) Abs[logK[[j + 1]] - logK[[j]]], 0.], {j, n - 1}]];\n\ndriftElectrodes = Sort @ DeleteDuplicates[electrodeOf[#File] & /@ goodSpecs];\ndriftGroups     = GroupBy[goodSpecs, electrodeOf[#File] &];\neColsDrift      = ColorData[97] /@ Range[Length[driftElectrodes]];\n\n(* {time h, capacitance nF} traces, one per electrode, for window wi (1 = slow, 2 = fast),\n   each spectrum integrated over its OWN gap-centred window (peakWindows, 4a.6) *)\ncapTraces[wi_] := Table[\n  SortBy[{#Spec[\"FinishTimeS\"]/3600., 1.*^9 modeCap[#Spec, peakWindows[#Spec][[wi]]]} & /@ driftGroups[e], First],\n  {e, driftElectrodes}];\n\ncapPanel[wi_, ttl_] := Module[{fg, bg, traces, allPts, tHi, yHi},\n  fg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White];\n  bg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", White, GrayLevel[0.12]];\n  traces = capTraces[wi]; allPts = Flatten[traces, 1];\n  tHi = Max[allPts[[All, 1]]]; yHi = 1.05 Max[allPts[[All, 2]]];\n  ListLinePlot[traces, Joined -> True, PlotMarkers -> {Automatic, 6},\n    PlotStyle -> (Directive[#, AbsoluteThickness[1.8]] & /@ eColsDrift),\n    PlotTheme -> \"Default\", Frame -> True, Axes -> False, Background -> bg,\n    FrameStyle -> Directive[fg, AbsoluteThickness[1.1]],\n    FrameTicks -> {{DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[0., yHi, fg], None}, {DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[0., tHi, fg], None}},\n    FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[fg, 12], LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 13, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"],\n    FrameLabel -> {Style[\"Time (hours)\", 14, fg], Style[\"Capacitance (nF)\", 14, fg]},\n    PlotLabel -> Style[ttl, 13, fg, Bold],\n    PlotRange -> {{0, tHi}, {0, yHi}}, PlotRangePadding -> Scaled[0.04],\n    PlotLegends -> Placed[LineLegend[eColsDrift, DCTPlots`ElectrodeName /@ driftElectrodes, LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 12]], Right],\n    ImageSize -> 480, AspectRatio -> 0.7]];\n\nRow[{capPanel[1, \"Slow mode (unfolded), 10 /s to gap centre\"],\n     Spacer[10],\n     capPanel[2, \"Fast mode (folded), gap centre to 500 /s\"]}]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "278e3dc6-fdcc-4fc0-a2d9-ea9d51baba69"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "#### 4a.8b Capacitance lost over the 24 h run\nThe area under g(k), ∫g d(log₁₀k), is the total faradaic capacitance of the reporters, so comparing it at the start and end of the run measures how much redox signal the sensor loses while held at 1000 µM vancomycin. The slow and fast mode capacitances (gap-centred windows, 4a.6) show where the loss comes from, and the double-layer capacitance C₀ is listed alongside as a reference that should barely move. Each end is the mean of the first or last three spectra, about 30 min, so a single noisy spectrum cannot set the number.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* 4a.8b  Capacitance at the start vs the end of the drift run, per electrode.\n   Faradaic = area under g(k) over the whole rate grid (IntegrateSpectrum = Sum[g]/B).\n   Slow/fast split uses each spectrum's own gap-centred windows (peakWindows, 4a.6), which\n   is defined further down, so it is only shown once 4a.6 has run. Each end = mean of\n   nEnd spectra. *)\nnEnd = 3;\nlossElectrodes = Sort @ DeleteDuplicates[electrodeOf[#File] & /@ goodSpecs];\n\nlossRow[e_] := Module[{s, a, b, tA, tB, cf, c0, split, slowA, slowB, fastA, fastB},\n  s = SortBy[Select[goodSpecs, electrodeOf[#File] === e &], #Spec[\"FinishTimeS\"] &];\n  {a, b} = {s[[;; nEnd]], s[[-nEnd ;;]]};\n  {tA, tB} = Mean[#Spec[\"FinishTimeS\"] & /@ #]/3600. & /@ {a, b};\n  cf = Mean[1*^9 DCTPeakAnalysis`IntegrateSpectrum[#Spec] & /@ #] & /@ {a, b};\n  c0 = Mean[1*^9 #Spec[\"C0\"] & /@ #] & /@ {a, b};\n  split = Length[DownValues[peakWindows]] > 0 && Length[DownValues[modeCap]] > 0;\n  {slowA, slowB} = If[split, Mean[1*^9 modeCap[#Spec, peakWindows[#Spec][[1]]] & /@ #] & /@ {a, b}, {Missing[], Missing[]}];\n  {fastA, fastB} = If[split, Mean[1*^9 modeCap[#Spec, peakWindows[#Spec][[2]]] & /@ #] & /@ {a, b}, {Missing[], Missing[]}];\n  <|\"Electrode\" -> DCTPlots`ElectrodeName[e], \"hours\" -> tB - tA,\n    \"CF0\" -> cf[[1]], \"CF1\" -> cf[[2]], \"slow0\" -> slowA, \"slow1\" -> slowB, \"fast0\" -> fastA, \"fast1\" -> fastB,\n    \"C00\" -> c0[[1]], \"C01\" -> c0[[2]]|>];\n\nlossRows = lossRow /@ lossElectrodes;\n\npctV[x0_, x1_] := 100 (x1 - x0)/x0;\npct[x0_, x1_] := If[NumericQ[x0] && NumericQ[x1], NumberForm[pctV[x0, x1], {3, 1}], \"n/a\"];\nnf0[x_] := If[NumericQ[x], Round[x], \"n/a\"];          (* whole nF, no trailing point *)\nlossTable = Grid[Join[\n   {Style[#, Bold] & /@ {\"Electrode\", \"span (h)\", \"faradaic \\:222bg (nF)\\nstart \\[RightArrow] end\", \"change (%)\", \"per hour (%/h)\",\n      \"slow mode (nF)\\nstart \\[RightArrow] end\", \"change (%)\", \"fast mode (nF)\\nstart \\[RightArrow] end\", \"change (%)\",\n      \"C\\:2080 (nF)\\nstart \\[RightArrow] end\", \"change (%)\"}},\n   Table[{r[\"Electrode\"], NumberForm[r[\"hours\"], {3, 1}],\n      Row[{nf0[r[\"CF0\"]], \" \\[RightArrow] \", nf0[r[\"CF1\"]]}], pct[r[\"CF0\"], r[\"CF1\"]],\n      NumberForm[pctV[r[\"CF0\"], r[\"CF1\"]]/r[\"hours\"], {3, 2}],\n      Row[{nf0[r[\"slow0\"]], \" \\[RightArrow] \", nf0[r[\"slow1\"]]}], pct[r[\"slow0\"], r[\"slow1\"]],\n      Row[{nf0[r[\"fast0\"]], \" \\[RightArrow] \", nf0[r[\"fast1\"]]}], pct[r[\"fast0\"], r[\"fast1\"]],\n      Row[{nf0[r[\"C00\"]], \" \\[RightArrow] \", nf0[r[\"C01\"]]}], pct[r[\"C00\"], r[\"C01\"]]}, {r, lossRows}],\n   {Style[#, Bold] & /@ {\"mean\", NumberForm[Mean[lossRows[[All, \"hours\"]]], {3, 1}],\n      Row[{nf0[Mean[lossRows[[All, \"CF0\"]]]], \" \\[RightArrow] \", nf0[Mean[lossRows[[All, \"CF1\"]]]]}],\n      NumberForm[Mean[pctV[#CF0, #CF1] & /@ lossRows], {3, 1}],\n      NumberForm[Mean[pctV[#CF0, #CF1]/#hours & /@ lossRows], {3, 2}],\n      \"\", If[NumericQ[lossRows[[1, \"slow0\"]]], NumberForm[Mean[pctV[#slow0, #slow1] & /@ lossRows], {3, 1}], \"n/a\"],\n      \"\", If[NumericQ[lossRows[[1, \"fast0\"]]], NumberForm[Mean[pctV[#fast0, #fast1] & /@ lossRows], {3, 1}], \"n/a\"],\n      \"\", NumberForm[Mean[pctV[#C00, #C01] & /@ lossRows], {3, 1}]}}],\n  Frame -> All, Alignment -> {{Left, Right}}, Spacings -> {1.1, 0.6}, ItemSize -> Full, Background -> White,\n  BaseStyle -> {FontFamily -> \"Arial\", FontSize -> 11, FontColor -> Black}];\n\nIf[!NumericQ[lossRows[[1, \"slow0\"]]],\n  Print[Style[\"Slow/fast split needs peakWindows (4a.6): run 4a.6, then re-run this cell.\", Italic, GrayLevel[0.5]]]];\nPrint[lossTable];\n\n(* one-line summary *)\nWith[{cfP = pctV[#CF0, #CF1] & /@ lossRows, c0P = pctV[#C00, #C01] & /@ lossRows, h = Mean[lossRows[[All, \"hours\"]]]},\n  Style[Row[{\"Over \", NumberForm[h, {3, 1}], \" h at 1000 \\[Mu]M vancomycin the faradaic capacitance falls by \",\n    NumberForm[-Mean[cfP], {3, 1}], \" \\[PlusMinus] \", NumberForm[StandardDeviation[cfP], {2, 1}], \"% (\",\n    NumberForm[-Mean[cfP]/h, {3, 2}], \"%/h, mean \\[PlusMinus] SD of three electrodes)\",\n    If[NumericQ[lossRows[[1, \"slow0\"]]],\n      Row[{\", the slow mode losing more (\", NumberForm[-Mean[pctV[#slow0, #slow1] & /@ lossRows], {3, 1}],\n        \"%) than the fast mode (\", NumberForm[-Mean[pctV[#fast0, #fast1] & /@ lossRows], {3, 1}], \"%)\"}], \"\"],\n    \", while the double-layer capacitance changes by only \", NumberForm[-Mean[c0P], {2, 1}], \"%.\"}],\n   FontFamily -> \"Arial\", 12]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"65\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6.04em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.29em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Electrode</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Electrode B1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Electrode B2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Electrode B3</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mean</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><s