   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 4a.9 Fast fraction vs time\nFast (folded) fraction ff = area(fast) / (area(slow) + area(fast)) over the 24 h drift run, one trace per electrode. Same quantity as section 5.4, here at fixed [vancomycin], so it reads as a stability check of the readout.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* 4a.9  Fast (folded) fraction vs time over the 24 h drift run, one trace per electrode:\n   ff = area(fast window) / (area(slow) + area(fast)), the same quantity as 5.4.\n   The y axis is zoomed to ffRange so the drift stability is readable; widen if the\n   fraction ever moves outside it. *)\nffRange = {0.0, 1.0};\nffTraces = Table[\n  SortBy[Module[{w = peakWindows[#Spec], a1, a2},\n      a1 = modeCap[#Spec, w[[1]]]; a2 = modeCap[#Spec, w[[2]]];\n      {#Spec[\"FinishTimeS\"]/3600., If[a1 + a2 > 0., a2/(a1 + a2), 0.]}] & /@ driftGroups[e], First],\n  {e, driftElectrodes}];\n\nModule[{fg, bg, tHi},\n  fg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White];\n  bg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", White, GrayLevel[0.12]];\n  tHi = Max[Flatten[ffTraces, 1][[All, 1]]];\n  ListLinePlot[ffTraces, Joined -> True, PlotMarkers -> {Automatic, 6},\n    PlotStyle -> (Directive[#, AbsoluteThickness[1.8]] & /@ eColsDrift),\n    PlotTheme -> \"Default\", Frame -> True, Axes -> False, Background -> bg,\n    FrameStyle -> Directive[fg, AbsoluteThickness[1.1]],\n    FrameTicks -> {{DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[ffRange[[1]], ffRange[[2]], fg], None}, {DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[0., tHi, fg], None}},\n    FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[fg, 12], LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 13, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"],\n    FrameLabel -> {Style[\"Time (hours)\", 14, fg], Style[\"Fast (folded) fraction\", 14, fg]},\n    PlotRange -> {{0, tHi}, ffRange}, PlotRangePadding -> {Scaled[0.04], None},\n    PlotLegends -> Placed[LineLegend[eColsDrift, DCTPlots`ElectrodeName /@ driftElectrodes, LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 12]], Right],\n    ImageSize -> 560, AspectRatio -> 0.65]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"23243\" data-output-id=\"50\" data-out-n=\"367\" data-sub-idx=\"3\" data-output-format=\"SVG\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"67\" data-sub-start=\"11\" data-sub-end=\"24\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[367]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\\\Users\\\\Bob Lansdorp\\\\Documents\\\\DCT\\\\img\\\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\\\wl_1n5yehthyb27k.svg\" width=\"895\" height=\"516\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_1n5yehthyb27k.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* 4a.9  Fast (folded) fraction vs time over the 24 h drift run, one trace per electrode:\n   ff = area(fast window) / (area(slow) + area(fast)), the same quantity as 5.4.\n   The y axis is zoomed to ffRange so the drift stability is readable; widen if the\n   fraction ever moves outside it. *)\nffRange = {0.0, 1.0};\nffTraces = Table[\n  SortBy[Module[{w = peakWindows[#Spec], a1, a2},\n      a1 = modeCap[#Spec, w[[1]]]; a2 = modeCap[#Spec, w[[2]]];\n      {#Spec[\"FinishTimeS\"]/3600., If[a1 + a2 > 0., a2/(a1 + a2), 0.]}] & /@ driftGroups[e], First],\n  {e, driftElectrodes}];\n\nModule[{fg, bg, tHi},\n  fg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White];\n  bg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", White, GrayLevel[0.12]];\n  tHi = Max[Flatten[ffTraces, 1][[All, 1]]];\n  ListLinePlot[ffTraces, Joined -> True, PlotMarkers -> {Automatic, 6},\n    PlotStyle -> (Directive[#, AbsoluteThickness[1.8]] & /@ eColsDrift),\n    PlotTheme -> \"Default\", Frame -> True, Axes -> False, Background -> bg,\n    FrameStyle -> Directive[fg, AbsoluteThickness[1.1]],\n    FrameTicks -> {{DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[ffRange[[1]], ffRange[[2]], fg], None}, {DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[0., tHi, fg], None}},\n    FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[fg, 12], LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 13, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"],\n    FrameLabel -> {Style[\"Time (hours)\", 14, fg], Style[\"Fast (folded) fraction\", 14, fg]},\n    PlotRange -> {{0, tHi}, ffRange}, PlotRangePadding -> {Scaled[0.04], None},\n    PlotLegends -> Placed[LineLegend[eColsDrift, DCTPlots`ElectrodeName /@ driftElectrodes, LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 12]], Right],\n    ImageSize -> 560, AspectRatio -> 0.65]]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "a64d3eeb-15c7-4f69-a9b4-1f0dba54f26b"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 4a.10 Combined drift figure (publication)\nOne figure for what happens to a sensor held for 24 hours at saturating target (1000 µM vancomycin, continuing directly from the end of the B-series titration), combining what 4a.5, 4a.8 and 4a.9 show separately: **a** the solution resistance, **b** the double-layer capacitance C0, **c** the capacitance of each mode (solid = slow/unfolded, dashed = fast/folded, integrated over each spectrum's own gap-centred windows), and **d** the fast-mode capacitive fraction on the `ffRange` axis set in 4a.9. One colour per electrode throughout, one shared legend.\n\nBecause the target is saturating throughout, the fraction should stay constant, which makes this a stability control for the concentration work. It separates what drifts from what does not: the mode capacitances fall by 16 to 27% over 24 h (roughly 1%/h) and the solution resistance by 12 to 13%, while the double-layer capacitance changes by under 2% and the fast-mode capacitive fraction by only 0.01 to 0.03. The publication copy (white background, PDF and 300 dpi PNG) is written by the export hub in 6.1 as `drift_overview`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* 4a.10  One combined drift figure: 4a.5 (Rs, C0), 4a.8 (mode capacitance) and 4a.9\n   (fast-mode capacitive fraction) as panels a to d, one colour per electrode. Every\n   spectrum is integrated over its OWN gap-centred windows (peakWindows, 4a.6).\n   No markers: each trace carries ~290 points, so lines alone are cleaner in print.\n   Panels go in a Grid, never a Row: a Row wraps to the page width when rasterised.\n   Panel d keeps the ffRange set in 4a.9, so the fraction is shown on an absolute scale.\n   The publication copy (white, PDF + 300 dpi PNG) is written by the export hub in 6.1\n   as drift_overview; this cell only defines driftFigure[] and shows it in the notebook. *)\ndriftSeries[e_, f_] := SortBy[\n  Map[Function[r, {r[\"Spec\"][\"FinishTimeS\"]/3600., f[r[\"Spec\"]]}], driftGroups[e]], First];\n\ndriftRs   = Table[driftSeries[e, Function[s, s[\"Rs\"]]], {e, driftElectrodes}];\ndriftC0   = Table[driftSeries[e, Function[s, 1.*^9 s[\"C0\"]]], {e, driftElectrodes}];\ndriftSlow = Table[driftSeries[e, Function[s, 1.*^9 modeCap[s, peakWindows[s][[1]]]]], {e, driftElectrodes}];\ndriftFast = Table[driftSeries[e, Function[s, 1.*^9 modeCap[s, peakWindows[s][[2]]]]], {e, driftElectrodes}];\ndriftFF   = Table[driftSeries[e, Function[s, Module[{w = peakWindows[s], a1, a2},\n     a1 = modeCap[s, w[[1]]]; a2 = modeCap[s, w[[2]]];\n     If[a1 + a2 > 0., a2/(a1 + a2), 0.]]]], {e, driftElectrodes}];\n\ndriftTHi = Max[Flatten[driftRs, 1][[All, 1]]];\n\n(* one panel: traces, their styles, y label, panel letter, y range, optional inset legend *)\ndriftPanel[traces_, styles_, yLab_, tag_, {yLo_, yHi_}, inset_] := Module[{fg, bg},\n  fg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White];\n  bg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", White, GrayLevel[0.12]];\n  ListLinePlot[traces, Joined -> True, PlotMarkers -> None,\n    PlotStyle -> styles, PlotTheme -> \"Default\", Frame -> True, Axes -> False, Background -> bg,\n    FrameStyle -> Directive[fg, AbsoluteThickness[1.1]],\n    FrameTicks -> {{DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[yLo, yHi, fg], None},\n                   {DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[0., driftTHi, fg], None}},\n    FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[fg, 12], LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 13, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"],\n    FrameLabel -> {Style[\"Time (hours)\", 14, fg], Style[yLab, 14, fg]},\n    PlotRange -> {{0, driftTHi}, {yLo, yHi}}, PlotRangePadding -> {Scaled[0.03], None},\n    Epilog -> {Text[Style[tag, 16, Bold, fg], Scaled[{0.035, 0.94}], {-1, 1}]},\n    Sequence @@ If[inset === None, {}, {PlotLegends -> inset}],\n    ImageSize -> 440, AspectRatio -> 0.72]];\n\neCols     = ColorData[97] /@ Range[Length[driftElectrodes]];\nsolidSty  = Directive[#, AbsoluteThickness[1.6]] & /@ eCols;\ndashedSty = Directive[#, AbsoluteThickness[1.6], Dashing[{0.02, 0.014}]] & /@ eCols;\npad[tr_] := Module[{v = Flatten[tr, 1][[All, 2]], lo, hi, d}, {lo, hi} = MinMax[v];\n  d = Max[0.08 (hi - lo), 0.02 Abs[hi]]; {Max[0., lo - d], hi + d}];\n\ndriftFigure[] := Module[{fg, modeLeg},\n  fg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White];\n  (* slow vs fast is encoded by line style, so it needs its own small legend. It sits in\n     the gap between the two groups of traces, around 110 nF. *)\n  modeLeg = Placed[LineLegend[{Directive[fg, AbsoluteThickness[1.6]],\n      Directive[fg, AbsoluteThickness[1.6], Dashing[{0.02, 0.014}]]},\n      {\"slow (unfolded)\", \"fast (folded)\"}, LegendMarkerSize -> 26,\n      LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 11]], {0.76, 0.40}];\n  Legended[\n    Grid[{{driftPanel[driftRs, solidSty, Row[{\"Solution resistance \", Subscript[\"R\", \"s\"], \" (\\[CapitalOmega])\"}], \"a\", pad[driftRs], None],\n           driftPanel[driftC0, solidSty, Row[{\"Double-layer capacitance \", Subscript[\"C\", \"dl\"], \" (nF)\"}], \"b\", pad[driftC0], None]},\n          {driftPanel[Join[driftSlow, driftFast], Join[solidSty, dashedSty], \"Mode capacitance (nF)\", \"c\",\n             pad[Join[driftSlow, driftFast]], modeLeg],\n           driftPanel[driftFF, solidSty, \"Fast-mode capacitive fraction\", \"d\", ffRange, None]}},\n      Spacings -> {1, 0.6}],\n    Placed[LineLegend[eCols, DCTPlots`ElectrodeName /@ driftElectrodes, LegendLayout -> \"Row\",\n      LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 12]], Bottom]]];\n\ndriftFigure[]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"23243\" data-output-id=\"51\" data-out-n=\"381\" data-sub-idx=\"15\" data-output-format=\"SVG\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"69\" data-sub-start=\"61\" data-sub-end=\"61\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[381]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\\\Users\\\\Bob Lansdorp\\\\Documents\\\\DCT\\\\img\\\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\\\wl_wazgofc21z78.svg\" width=\"1191\" height=\"940\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_wazgofc21z78.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* 4a.10  One combined drift figure: 4a.5 (Rs, C0), 4a.8 (mode capacitance) and 4a.9\n   (fast-mode capacitive fraction) as panels a to d, one colour per electrode. Every\n   spectrum is integrated over its OWN gap-centred windows (peakWindows, 4a.6).\n   No markers: each trace carries ~290 points, so lines alone are cleaner in print.\n   Panels go in a Grid, never a Row: a Row wraps to the page width when rasterised.\n   Panel d keeps the ffRange set in 4a.9, so the fraction is shown on an absolute scale.\n   The publication copy (white, PDF + 300 dpi PNG) is written by the export hub in 6.1\n   as drift_overview; this cell only defines driftFigure[] and shows it in the notebook. *)\ndriftSeries[e_, f_] := SortBy[\n  Map[Function[r, {r[\"Spec\"][\"FinishTimeS\"]/3600., f[r[\"Spec\"]]}], driftGroups[e]], First];\n\ndriftRs   = Table[driftSeries[e, Function[s, s[\"Rs\"]]], {e, driftElectrodes}];\ndriftC0   = Table[driftSeries[e, Function[s, 1.*^9 s[\"C0\"]]], {e, driftElectrodes}];\ndriftSlow = Table[driftSeries[e, Function[s, 1.*^9 modeCap[s, peakWindows[s][[1]]]]], {e, driftElectrodes}];\ndriftFast = Table[driftSeries[e, Function[s, 1.*^9 modeCap[s, peakWindows[s][[2]]]]], {e, driftElectrodes}];\ndriftFF   = Table[driftSeries[e, Function[s, Module[{w = peakWindows[s], a1, a2},\n     a1 = modeCap[s, w[[1]]]; a2 = modeCap[s, w[[2]]];\n     If[a1 + a2 > 0., a2/(a1 + a2), 0.]]]], {e, driftElectrodes}];\n\ndriftTHi = Max[Flatten[driftRs, 1][[All, 1]]];\n\n(* one panel: traces, their styles, y label, panel letter, y range, optional inset legend *)\ndriftPanel[traces_, styles_, yLab_, tag_, {yLo_, yHi_}, inset_] := Module[{fg, bg},\n  fg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White];\n  bg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", White, GrayLevel[0.12]];\n  ListLinePlot[traces, Joined -> True, PlotMarkers -> None,\n    PlotStyle -> styles, PlotTheme -> \"Default\", Frame -> True, Axes -> False, Background -> bg,\n    FrameStyle -> Directive[fg, AbsoluteThickness[1.1]],\n    FrameTicks -> {{DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[yLo, yHi, fg], None},\n                   {DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[0., driftTHi, fg], None}},\n    FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[fg, 12], LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 13, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"],\n    FrameLabel -> {Style[\"Time (hours)\", 14, fg], Style[yLab, 14, fg]},\n    PlotRange -> {{0, driftTHi}, {yLo, yHi}}, PlotRangePadding -> {Scaled[0.03], None},\n    Epilog -> {Text[Style[tag, 16, Bold, fg], Scaled[{0.035, 0.94}], {-1, 1}]},\n    Sequence @@ If[inset === None, {}, {PlotLegends -> inset}],\n    ImageSize -> 440, AspectRatio -> 0.72]];\n\neCols     = ColorData[97] /@ Range[Length[driftElectrodes]];\nsolidSty  = Directive[#, AbsoluteThickness[1.6]] & /@ eCols;\ndashedSty = Directive[#, AbsoluteThickness[1.6], Dashing[{0.02, 0.014}]] & /@ eCols;\npad[tr_] := Module[{v = Flatten[tr, 1][[All, 2]], lo, hi, d}, {lo, hi} = MinMax[v];\n  d = Max[0.08 (hi - lo), 0.02 Abs[hi]]; {Max[0., lo - d], hi + d}];\n\ndriftFigure[] := Module[{fg, modeLeg},\n  fg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White];\n  (* slow vs fast is encoded by line style, so it needs its own small legend. It sits in\n     the gap between the two groups of traces, around 110 nF. *)\n  modeLeg = Placed[LineLegend[{Directive[fg, AbsoluteThickness[1.6]],\n      Directive[fg, AbsoluteThickness[1.6], Dashing[{0.02, 0.014}]]},\n      {\"slow (unfolded)\", \"fast (folded)\"}, LegendMarkerSize -> 26,\n      LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 11]], {0.76, 0.40}];\n  Legended[\n    Grid[{{driftPanel[driftRs, solidSty, Row[{\"Solution resistance \", Subscript[\"R\", \"s\"], \" (\\[CapitalOmega])\"}], \"a\", pad[driftRs], None],\n           driftPanel[driftC0, solidSty, Row[{\"Double-layer capacitance \", Subscript[\"C\", \"dl\"], \" (nF)\"}], \"b\", pad[driftC0], None]},\n          {driftPanel[Join[driftSlow, driftFast], Join[solidSty, dashedSty], \"Mode capacitance (nF)\", \"c\",\n             pad[Join[driftSlow, driftFast]], modeLeg],\n           driftPanel[driftFF, solidSty, \"Fast-mode capacitive fraction\", \"d\", ffRange, None]}},\n      Spacings -> {1, 0.6}],\n    Placed[LineLegend[eCols, DCTPlots`ElectrodeName /@ driftElectrodes, LegendLayout -> \"Row\",\n      LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 12]], Bottom]]];\n\ndriftFigure[]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "1b530373-cc0b-4416-8a3b-8f04038da104"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 5. Concentration Analysis\nSet `concentrationDir` in the params cell first. Uses the same locked parameters as the drift fit.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 5.1 Batch concentration fit",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Batch-fit concentration files from BOTH directories with the locked parameters.\n   Each directory carries its series letter (seriesOfDir, section 0): the 2026-02-25\n   titration is series A, the 2026-03-24 titration is series B, so the two titrations\n   combine into a single 6-electrode concGoodSpecs labelled A1\\[Dash]A3 and B1\\[Dash]B3.\n   B1\\[Dash]B3 are the same physical chips as the drift run in section 4a. *)\n\nconcElec[f_] := First[StringCases[FileNameTake[f], \"E\" ~~ d : DigitCharacter :> d], \"0\"];\nconcUM[f_]   := ToExpression @ First[StringCases[FileNameTake[f], n : NumberString ~~ \"uM\" :> n], \"0\"];\n(* [vancomycin] in uM from a label such as \"B1 100 uM\" (used from 5.3.2b on) *)\ngetLabelUM[lbl_] := ToExpression @ First[StringCases[lbl, n:NumberString ~~ \" \\[Mu]M\" :> n], \"0\"];\nconcTag[f_, series_]   := series <> concElec[f];\nconcLabelOff[f_, series_] := Module[{conc},\n  conc = First[StringCases[FileNameTake[f], n : NumberString ~~ \"uM\" :> n], \"?\"];\n  concTag[f, series] <> \" \" <> conc <> \" \\[Mu]M\"\n];\n\nfitConcDir[dir_, series_] := If[!StringQ[dir] || dir === \"\" || !DirectoryQ[dir], {},\n  Module[{files},\n    files = SortBy[FileNames[\"*.txt\", dir], {concElec[#], concUM[#]} &];\n    Print[\"  \", FileNameTake[dir], \":  \", Length[files], \" files  (series \", series, \")\"];\n    Table[\n      Module[{spec},\n        spec = Quiet @ Check[\n          DCT`DCTSpectrum[files[[i]],\n            \"LambdaND\" -> lambdaND, \"FMinUse\" -> fMinHz, \"FMaxUse\" -> fMaxHz,\n            \"WeightPower\" -> weightPower, \"BinsPerDecade\" -> binsPerDecade,\n            \"TauMinFactor\" -> tauMinFactor, \"TauMaxFactor\" -> tauMaxFactor], $Failed];\n        <|\"File\" -> concLabelOff[files[[i]], series], \"Spec\" -> spec, \"OK\" -> AssociationQ[spec]|>\n      ],\n      {i, Length[files]}]\n  ]\n];\n\nPrint[\"Fitting concentration data (\", fMinHz, \" \\[Dash] \", fMaxHz, \" Hz):\"];\nconcResults    = Join[fitConcDir[concentrationDir, seriesOfDir[concentrationDir]], fitConcDir[concentrationDir2, seriesOfDir[concentrationDir2]]];\nconcGoodSpecs  = Select[concResults, #OK === True &];\nconcElectrodes = Sort @ DeleteDuplicates[StringTake[#[\"File\"], 2] & /@ concGoodSpecs];\n\nPrint[Style[\n  ToString[Length[concGoodSpecs]] <> \" / \" <> ToString[Length[concResults]] <>\n  \" fits succeeded \\[Dash] electrodes \" <> StringRiffle[concElectrodes, \", \"] <> \".\",\n  Bold, Darker[Green]]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><span class=\"wl-ps\">Fitting concentration data (</span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"64\" data-latex-b64=\"Mi41MTE5\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.5119</span></span></span></span></span></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> – </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"64\" data-latex-b64=\"NTAwLlws\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span></span></span></span></span></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> Hz):</span></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: Fitting concentration data ([formula] –[formula] Hz):",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "e99c36cf-5567-4852-9532-923f59925987"
    },
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><span class=\"wl-ps\">  </span><span class=\"wl-ps\">EIS</span><span class=\"wl-ps\">:  </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"64\" data-latex-b64=\"MjQ=\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span></span></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> files  (series </span><span class=\"wl-ps\">B</span><span class=\"wl-ps\">)</span></div></div><div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><span class=\"wl-ps\">  </span><span class=\"wl-ps\">EIS</span><span class=\"wl-ps\">:  </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"64\" data-latex-b64=\"MTU=\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> files  (series </span><span class=\"wl-ps\">A</span><span class=\"wl-ps\">)</span></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
