  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 5.3.2d The full measured frequency range\nThe same 12 panels as 5.3.2c, but with every measured point from 0.1 Hz to 10 kHz (51 points per spectrum, read back from the raw files), not only the analysis band. The DCT fit (solid line, same colour) is drawn only over the band it was fitted to, shaded and bounded by the dashed grey lines at fMinHz and the highest fitted frequency; it is not extrapolated beyond it. Below the band the measured phase levels off at about 85 to 87° rather than approaching 90°. Exported by 6.1 as `admittance_full_range`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* 5.3.2d  Full measured range (0.1 Hz to 10 kHz): raw points, with the DCT fit drawn only over\n   the fitted band (shaded). Same layout, colours and styling as 5.3.2c. *)\n\n(* {conc, data|Y|, data phase, model|Y| in band, model|Y| below, model|Y| above, same x3 for phase, {fBandLo, fBandHi}} *)\nadmFullTrace[r_] := Module[{s = r[\"Spec\"], tag = StringTake[r[\"File\"], 2], um = N @ getLabelUM[r[\"File\"]],\n    raw, fR, yR, fM, yM, bLo, bHi, seg, mag, ph},\n  raw = DCTDataImport`ImportEIS[nyqConcFile[tag, um]];\n  fR = raw[\"FreqHz\"]; yR = 1./raw[\"Z\"];\n  {bLo, bHi} = MinMax[s[\"FreqHz\"]];\n  (* dense model grid over the full measured range *)\n  fM = 10.^Subdivide[Log10[Min[fR]], Log10[Max[fR]], 200];\n  yM = 1./DCTKernel`SimulateEIS[s[\"g\"], s[\"Tau\"], s[\"Rs\"], s[\"C0\"], fM];\n  mag = Transpose[{fM, 1*^6 Abs[yM]}]; ph = Transpose[{fM, (180./Pi) Arg[yM]}];\n  (* split into below / in / above the band, overlapping one point so the line is continuous *)\n  seg[pts_] := {Select[pts, bLo <= #[[1]] <= bHi &],\n    Select[pts, #[[1]] <= bLo 1.03 &], Select[pts, #[[1]] >= bHi/1.03 &]};\n  {um, Transpose[{fR, 1*^6 Abs[yR]}], Transpose[{fR, (180./Pi) Arg[yR]}], seg[mag], seg[ph], {bLo, bHi}}];\nadmFullTraces[tag_] := SortBy[admFullTrace /@ Select[concGoodSpecs, StringStartsQ[#File, tag <> \" \"] &], First];\n\n(* which = \"mag\" | \"phase\" *)\nadmFullPanel[tr_, which_, ttl_, {yLo_, yHi_}, {fLo_, fHi_}] := Module[{fg, bg, cols, dIdx, mIdx, plotF, yTicks, yLab, common, band, bandCol},\n  fg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White];\n  bg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", White, GrayLevel[0.12]];\n  bandCol = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", GrayLevel[0.92], GrayLevel[0.2]];\n  cols = nyqConcCol /@ tr[[All, 1]];\n  {dIdx, mIdx} = If[which === \"mag\", {2, 4}, {3, 5}];\n  plotF  = If[which === \"mag\", ListLogLogPlot, ListLogLinearPlot];\n  yTicks = If[which === \"mag\", DCTPlots`ThemeLogTicks[yLo, yHi, fg], DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[yLo, yHi, fg]];\n  yLab   = If[which === \"mag\", \"|Y| (\\[Mu]S)\", \"phase of Y (\\[Degree])\"];\n  band = tr[[1, 6]];\n  (* band shading in plot coordinates: the log plots work in NATURAL log internally *)\n  With[{yy = If[which === \"mag\", Log[{yLo, yHi} {0.5, 2.}], {yLo, yHi} + {-50, 50}], bx = Log[band]},\n   common = Sequence[PlotTheme -> \"Default\", Frame -> True, Axes -> False, Background -> bg,\n    Prolog -> {bandCol, Rectangle[{bx[[1]], yy[[1]]}, {bx[[2]], yy[[2]]}],\n      GrayLevel[0.5], Dashing[{0.012, 0.012}], AbsoluteThickness[0.8],\n      Line[{{bx[[1]], yy[[1]]}, {bx[[1]], yy[[2]]}}], Line[{{bx[[2]], yy[[1]]}, {bx[[2]], yy[[2]]}}]},\n    FrameStyle -> Directive[fg, AbsoluteThickness[1.1]],\n    FrameTicks -> {{yTicks, None}, {DCTPlots`ThemeLogTicks[fLo, fHi, fg], None}},\n    FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[fg, 10], LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 11, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"],\n    FrameLabel -> {Style[\"Frequency (Hz)\", 11, fg], Style[yLab, 11, fg]},\n    PlotLabel -> Style[ttl, 11, Bold, fg],\n    PlotRange -> {{fLo, fHi}, {yLo, yHi}}, PlotRangePadding -> {Scaled[0.03], Scaled[0.04]},\n    ImageSize -> 320, AspectRatio -> 0.7]];\n  Show[\n    plotF[tr[[All, mIdx, 1]], Joined -> True, PlotMarkers -> None,\n      PlotStyle -> (Directive[#, AbsoluteThickness[1.3]] & /@ cols), common],\n    plotF[tr[[All, dIdx]], Joined -> False,\n      PlotStyle -> (Directive[#, PointSize[0.012]] & /@ cols), PlotMarkers -> None, common]]];\n\nadmittanceFullRangeFigure[] := Module[{fg, series, rows, fLo, fHi, concs, concLeg, styleLeg},\n  fg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White];\n  series = Select[Table[{s, Select[Table[{s <> ToString[i], admFullTraces[s <> ToString[i]]}, {i, 3}], #[[2]] =!= {} &]}, {s, {\"A\", \"B\"}}], #[[2]] =!= {} &];\n  If[Length[series] < 2, Print[Style[\"Full-range admittance: only \" <> ToString[Length[series]] <>\n    \" titration series has data; check concentrationDir / concentrationDir2.\", Italic, Darker[Red]]]];\n  {fLo, fHi} = MinMax[Flatten[series[[All, 2, All, 2, All, 2, All, 1]]]];\n  rows = Flatten[Table[Module[{panels = ser[[2]], magR, phR},\n      (* scales from the measured points only, so a wild extrapolation cannot set them *)\n      magR = MinMax[Flatten[panels[[All, 2, All, 2, All, 2]]]];\n      phR  = Clip[MinMax[Flatten[panels[[All, 2, All, 3, All, 2]]]], {-10., 95.}];\n      phR  = {Floor[phR[[1]] - 1, 10], Ceiling[phR[[2]] + 1, 10]};\n      {Table[admFullPanel[p[[2]], \"mag\", DCTPlots`ElectrodeName[p[[1]]] <> \", |Y|\", {0.7, 1.4} magR, {fLo, fHi}], {p, panels}],\n       Table[admFullPanel[p[[2]], \"phase\", DCTPlots`ElectrodeName[p[[1]]] <> \", phase\", phR, {fLo, fHi}], {p, panels}]}],\n    {ser, series}], 1];\n  concs = Union @ Flatten[series[[All, 2, All, 2, All, 1]]];\n  concLeg = LineLegend[Directive[nyqConcCol[#], AbsoluteThickness[2]] & /@ concs,\n    (ToString[Round[#]] <> \" \\[Mu]M\") & /@ concs, LegendLayout -> {\"Row\", 1}, LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 11]];\n  styleLeg = Row[{Graphics[{fg, PointSize[Large], Point[{0, 0}]}, ImageSize -> 10], \" measured   \",\n    Graphics[{fg, AbsoluteThickness[1.5], Line[{{0, 0}, {1, 0}}]}, ImageSize -> {26, 8}, PlotRange -> {{0, 1}, {-1, 1}}, AspectRatio -> 0.3], \" DCT fit (over the fitted band, shaded)\"},\n    BaseStyle -> {fg, 11, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"}];\n  Legended[Grid[rows, Spacings -> {0.6, 0.6}], Placed[Column[{concLeg, styleLeg}, Alignment -> Center], Bottom]]];\n\nadmittanceFullRangeFigure[]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"23243\" data-output-id=\"58\" data-out-n=\"445\" data-sub-idx=\"7\" data-output-format=\"SVG\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"86\" data-sub-start=\"71\" data-sub-end=\"71\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[445]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\\\Users\\\\Bob Lansdorp\\\\Documents\\\\DCT\\\\img\\\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\\\wl_1jrcuthn994te.svg\" width=\"1301\" height=\"1435\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_1jrcuthn994te.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* 5.3.2d  Full measured range (0.1 Hz to 10 kHz): raw points, with the DCT fit drawn only over\n   the fitted band (shaded). Same layout, colours and styling as 5.3.2c. *)\n\n(* {conc, data|Y|, data phase, model|Y| in band, model|Y| below, model|Y| above, same x3 for phase, {fBandLo, fBandHi}} *)\nadmFullTrace[r_] := Module[{s = r[\"Spec\"], tag = StringTake[r[\"File\"], 2], um = N @ getLabelUM[r[\"File\"]],\n    raw, fR, yR, fM, yM, bLo, bHi, seg, mag, ph},\n  raw = DCTDataImport`ImportEIS[nyqConcFile[tag, um]];\n  fR = raw[\"FreqHz\"]; yR = 1./raw[\"Z\"];\n  {bLo, bHi} = MinMax[s[\"FreqHz\"]];\n  (* dense model grid over the full measured range *)\n  fM = 10.^Subdivide[Log10[Min[fR]], Log10[Max[fR]], 200];\n  yM = 1./DCTKernel`SimulateEIS[s[\"g\"], s[\"Tau\"], s[\"Rs\"], s[\"C0\"], fM];\n  mag = Transpose[{fM, 1*^6 Abs[yM]}]; ph = Transpose[{fM, (180./Pi) Arg[yM]}];\n  (* split into below / in / above the band, overlapping one point so the line is continuous *)\n  seg[pts_] := {Select[pts, bLo <= #[[1]] <= bHi &],\n    Select[pts, #[[1]] <= bLo 1.03 &], Select[pts, #[[1]] >= bHi/1.03 &]};\n  {um, Transpose[{fR, 1*^6 Abs[yR]}], Transpose[{fR, (180./Pi) Arg[yR]}], seg[mag], seg[ph], {bLo, bHi}}];\nadmFullTraces[tag_] := SortBy[admFullTrace /@ Select[concGoodSpecs, StringStartsQ[#File, tag <> \" \"] &], First];\n\n(* which = \"mag\" | \"phase\" *)\nadmFullPanel[tr_, which_, ttl_, {yLo_, yHi_}, {fLo_, fHi_}] := Module[{fg, bg, cols, dIdx, mIdx, plotF, yTicks, yLab, common, band, bandCol},\n  fg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White];\n  bg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", White, GrayLevel[0.12]];\n  bandCol = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", GrayLevel[0.92], GrayLevel[0.2]];\n  cols = nyqConcCol /@ tr[[All, 1]];\n  {dIdx, mIdx} = If[which === \"mag\", {2, 4}, {3, 5}];\n  plotF  = If[which === \"mag\", ListLogLogPlot, ListLogLinearPlot];\n  yTicks = If[which === \"mag\", DCTPlots`ThemeLogTicks[yLo, yHi, fg], DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[yLo, yHi, fg]];\n  yLab   = If[which === \"mag\", \"|Y| (\\[Mu]S)\", \"phase of Y (\\[Degree])\"];\n  band = tr[[1, 6]];\n  (* band shading in plot coordinates: the log plots work in NATURAL log internally *)\n  With[{yy = If[which === \"mag\", Log[{yLo, yHi} {0.5, 2.}], {yLo, yHi} + {-50, 50}], bx = Log[band]},\n   common = Sequence[PlotTheme -> \"Default\", Frame -> True, Axes -> False, Background -> bg,\n    Prolog -> {bandCol, Rectangle[{bx[[1]], yy[[1]]}, {bx[[2]], yy[[2]]}],\n      GrayLevel[0.5], Dashing[{0.012, 0.012}], AbsoluteThickness[0.8],\n      Line[{{bx[[1]], yy[[1]]}, {bx[[1]], yy[[2]]}}], Line[{{bx[[2]], yy[[1]]}, {bx[[2]], yy[[2]]}}]},\n    FrameStyle -> Directive[fg, AbsoluteThickness[1.1]],\n    FrameTicks -> {{yTicks, None}, {DCTPlots`ThemeLogTicks[fLo, fHi, fg], None}},\n    FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[fg, 10], LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 11, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"],\n    FrameLabel -> {Style[\"Frequency (Hz)\", 11, fg], Style[yLab, 11, fg]},\n    PlotLabel -> Style[ttl, 11, Bold, fg],\n    PlotRange -> {{fLo, fHi}, {yLo, yHi}}, PlotRangePadding -> {Scaled[0.03], Scaled[0.04]},\n    ImageSize -> 320, AspectRatio -> 0.7]];\n  Show[\n    plotF[tr[[All, mIdx, 1]], Joined -> True, PlotMarkers -> None,\n      PlotStyle -> (Directive[#, AbsoluteThickness[1.3]] & /@ cols), common],\n    plotF[tr[[All, dIdx]], Joined -> False,\n      PlotStyle -> (Directive[#, PointSize[0.012]] & /@ cols), PlotMarkers -> None, common]]];\n\nadmittanceFullRangeFigure[] := Module[{fg, series, rows, fLo, fHi, concs, concLeg, styleLeg},\n  fg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White];\n  series = Select[Table[{s, Select[Table[{s <> ToString[i], admFullTraces[s <> ToString[i]]}, {i, 3}], #[[2]] =!= {} &]}, {s, {\"A\", \"B\"}}], #[[2]] =!= {} &];\n  If[Length[series] < 2, Print[Style[\"Full-range admittance: only \" <> ToString[Length[series]] <>\n    \" titration series has data; check concentrationDir / concentrationDir2.\", Italic, Darker[Red]]]];\n  {fLo, fHi} = MinMax[Flatten[series[[All, 2, All, 2, All, 2, All, 1]]]];\n  rows = Flatten[Table[Module[{panels = ser[[2]], magR, phR},\n      (* scales from the measured points only, so a wild extrapolation cannot set them *)\n      magR = MinMax[Flatten[panels[[All, 2, All, 2, All, 2]]]];\n      phR  = Clip[MinMax[Flatten[panels[[All, 2, All, 3, All, 2]]]], {-10., 95.}];\n      phR  = {Floor[phR[[1]] - 1, 10], Ceiling[phR[[2]] + 1, 10]};\n      {Table[admFullPanel[p[[2]], \"mag\", DCTPlots`ElectrodeName[p[[1]]] <> \", |Y|\", {0.7, 1.4} magR, {fLo, fHi}], {p, panels}],\n       Table[admFullPanel[p[[2]], \"phase\", DCTPlots`ElectrodeName[p[[1]]] <> \", phase\", phR, {fLo, fHi}], {p, panels}]}],\n    {ser, series}], 1];\n  concs = Union @ Flatten[series[[All, 2, All, 2, All, 1]]];\n  concLeg = LineLegend[Directive[nyqConcCol[#], AbsoluteThickness[2]] & /@ concs,\n    (ToString[Round[#]] <> \" \\[Mu]M\") & /@ concs, LegendLayout -> {\"Row\", 1}, LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 11]];\n  styleLeg = Row[{Graphics[{fg, PointSize[Large], Point[{0, 0}]}, ImageSize -> 10], \" measured   \",\n    Graphics[{fg, AbsoluteThickness[1.5], Line[{{0, 0}, {1, 0}}]}, ImageSize -> {26, 8}, PlotRange -> {{0, 1}, {-1, 1}}, AspectRatio -> 0.3], \" DCT fit (over the fitted band, shaded)\"},\n    BaseStyle -> {fg, 11, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"}];\n  Legended[Grid[rows, Spacings -> {0.6, 0.6}], Placed[Column[{concLeg, styleLeg}, Alignment -> Center], Bottom]]];\n\nadmittanceFullRangeFigure[]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "04cfa9a7-4233-4b35-8809-d8e7db98f914"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 5.3.3 Mode capacitance vs concentration and vs time, per electrode\nStacked bars, one row per electrode: slow (unfolded, red, bottom) and fast (folded, blue, top) integrated g(k) capacitance, so bar height is the total capacitance. Left panels: vs [vancomycin] on a log axis with equal-width bars (0 µM parked at the left). Right panels: the same bars vs acquisition time (linear, hours since that electrode's first spectrum), each labelled with its concentration, to separate a concentration effect from drift. All panels share one y scale. Each spectrum is integrated over its own gap-centred windows (`peakWindows`, 4a.6).\n\nBelow the bars, the two fitted circuit parameters against the same concentration axis, one trace per electrode: the solution resistance Rs from the outer Brent loop and the double-layer capacitance C_dl = C0. Neither is a binding observable, so these are controls: Rs sits at 158 to 290 Ω and is flat in concentration for every electrode, and C_dl is flat except for Electrode 6 at 100 µM, the same spectrum that gives the outlying 760 nF bar above.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* 5.3.3  Stacked mode-capacitance bars, one row per electrode. Left: vs [vancomycin] on a\n   log axis (equal-width bars, 0 uM parked at the left). Right: the same bars vs acquisition\n   time (linear, hours since that electrode's first spectrum), each labelled with its\n   concentration. Slow (unfolded) red at the bottom, fast (folded) blue on top, so bar\n   height = total capacitance. One shared y scale so totals compare across electrodes.\n   Integration = modeCap (4a.8) over each spectrum's own gap-centred windows (4a.6).\n   The 2026-02-25 files (series A, Electrodes A1 to A3) carry only a per-spectrum clock (~205 s each), so no\n   acquisition order is recoverable and their time panel is replaced by a note. *)\nslowCol = RGBColor[0.85, 0.25, 0.20];\nfastCol = RGBColor[0.20, 0.45, 0.85];\nbarX[c_] := If[c == 0, Log10[0.3], Log10[c]];   (* 0 uM sits at the left of the log axis *)\n\n(* {conc, time h, slow nF, fast nF} per spectrum of one electrode, in concentration order *)\ncapRecs[e_] := SortBy[Table[Module[{s = r[\"Spec\"], w = peakWindows[r[\"Spec\"]]},\n    {N@getLabelUM[r[\"File\"]], s[\"FinishTimeS\"]/3600., 1.*^9 modeCap[s, w[[1]]], 1.*^9 modeCap[s, w[[2]]]}],\n  {r, Select[concGoodSpecs, StringStartsQ[#File, e] &]}], First];\n\n(* generic stacked-bar panel: xs = bar centres, halfW = half width, both in axis units *)\nstackedBars[recs_, xs_, halfW_, xt_, xLab_, xRange_, yMax_, labels_, ttl_] := Module[{fg, bg, bars, txt},\n  fg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White];\n  bg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", White, GrayLevel[0.12]];\n  bars = MapThread[Function[{d, x},\n     {{slowCol, EdgeForm[Directive[fg, AbsoluteThickness[0.6]]], Rectangle[{x - halfW, 0}, {x + halfW, d[[3]]}]},\n      {fastCol, EdgeForm[Directive[fg, AbsoluteThickness[0.6]]], Rectangle[{x - halfW, d[[3]]}, {x + halfW, d[[3]] + d[[4]]}]}}],\n    {recs, xs}];\n  txt = If[labels === None, {},\n    MapThread[Text[Style[#2, fg, 9], {#3, #1[[3]] + #1[[4]]}, {0, -1.3}] &, {recs, labels, xs}]];\n  Graphics[{bars, txt},\n    Frame -> True, Axes -> False, Background -> bg, FrameStyle -> Directive[fg, AbsoluteThickness[1.1]],\n    FrameTicks -> {{DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[0., yMax, fg], None}, {xt, None}},\n    FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[fg, 11], LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 12, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"],\n    FrameLabel -> {Style[xLab, 12, fg], Style[\"Capacitance (nF)\", 12, fg]},\n    PlotLabel -> Style[ttl, 12, fg, Bold],\n    PlotRange -> {xRange, {0, yMax}}, PlotRangePadding -> None,\n    AspectRatio -> 0.7, ImageSize -> 430]];\n\n(* placeholder panel for electrodes whose files carry no run clock *)\nnoTimePanel[e_] := Module[{fg, bg},\n  fg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White];\n  bg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", White, GrayLevel[0.12]];\n  Graphics[{Text[Style[DCTPlots`ElectrodeName[e] <> \": no acquisition-time stamps in these files\\n(per-spectrum clock only)\", fg, 11], {0, 0}]},\n    Frame -> True, FrameTicks -> None, Background -> bg, FrameStyle -> Directive[fg, AbsoluteThickness[1.1]],\n    PlotRange -> {{-1, 1}, {-1, 1}}, AspectRatio -> 0.7, ImageSize -> 430]];\n\ncapAll = capRecs /@ concElectrodes;\ncapYMax = 1.12 Max[Flatten[#[[All, 3]] + #[[All, 4]] & /@ capAll]];   (* shared y scale *)\n\ncapPanels[e_, recs_] := Module[{fg, xtC, t0, tSpan, hwC, xC},\n  fg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White];\n  xtC = Join[{{barX[0], \"0\", {0, 0.016}, {fg}}},\n    {Log10[#], Superscript[10, Round@Log10[#]], {0, 0.016}, {fg}} & /@ {1., 10., 100., 1000.},\n    {Log10[#], \"\", {0, 0.008}, {fg}} & /@ Select[recs[[All, 1]], !MemberQ[{0., 1., 10., 100., 1000.}, #] &]];\n  xC = barX /@ recs[[All, 1]];\n  hwC = Min[0.09, 0.4 Min[Differences[Sort[xC]]]];   (* equal widths, no overlap of neighbours *)\n  t0 = Min[recs[[All, 2]]]; tSpan = Max[recs[[All, 2]]] - t0;\n  {stackedBars[recs, xC, hwC, xtC, \"[Vancomycin] (\\[Mu]M)\",\n     {barX[0] - 0.35, Log10[1000.] + 0.35}, capYMax, None, DCTPlots`ElectrodeName[e] <> \":  vs concentration\"],\n   If[tSpan < 0.1,   (* < 6 min across the whole set: no real run clock *)\n     noTimePanel[e],\n     stackedBars[recs, recs[[All, 2]] - t0, 0.022 tSpan, DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[0., 1.05 tSpan, fg],\n       \"Time since first spectrum (h)\", {-0.05 tSpan, 1.08 tSpan}, capYMax,\n       (ToString[Round[#]] <> \" \\[Mu]M\") & /@ recs[[All, 1]], DCTPlots`ElectrodeName[e] <> \":  vs acquisition time\"]]}];\n\nLegended[Grid[MapThread[capPanels, {concElectrodes, capAll}], Spacings -> {1, 1}],\n  Placed[SwatchLegend[{fastCol, slowCol}, {\"fast (folded)\", \"slow (unfolded)\"},\n    LabelStyle -> Directive[If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White], 12]], Bottom]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"23243\" data-output-id=\"59\" data-out-n=\"455\" data-sub-idx=\"13\" data-output-format=\"SVG\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"88\" data-sub-start=\"63\" data-sub-end=\"65\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[455]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\\\Users\\\\Bob Lansdorp\\\\Documents\\\\DCT\\\\img\\\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\\\wl_1s1kf3uyachp5.svg\" width=\"1164\" height=\"2785\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_1s1kf3uyachp5.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* 5.3.3  Stacked mode-capacitance bars, one row per electrode. Left: vs [vancomycin] on a\n   log axis (equal-width bars, 0 uM parked at the left). Right: the same bars vs acquisition\n   time (linear, hours since that electrode's first spectrum), each labelled with its\n   concentration. Slow (unfolded) red at the bottom, fast (folded) blue on top, so bar\n   height = total capacitance. One shared y scale so totals compare across electrodes.\n   Integration = modeCap (4a.8) over each spectrum's own gap-centred windows (4a.6).\n   The 2026-02-25 files (series A, Electrodes A1 to A3) carry only a per-spectrum clock (~205 s each), so no\n   acquisition order is recoverable and their time panel is replaced by a note. *)\nslowCol = RGBColor[0.85, 0.25, 0.20];\nfastCol = RGBColor[0.20, 0.45, 0.85];\nbarX[c_] := If[c == 0, Log10[0.3], Log10[c]];   (* 0 uM sits at the left of the log axis *)\n\n(* {conc, time h, slow nF, fast nF} per spectrum of one electrode, in concentration order *)\ncapRecs[e_] := SortBy[Table[Module[{s = r[\"Spec\"], w = peakWindows[r[\"Spec\"]]},\n    {N@getLabelUM[r[\"File\"]], s[\"FinishTimeS\"]/3600., 1.*^9 modeCap[s, w[[1]]], 1.*^9 modeCap[s, w[[2]]]}],\n  {r, Select[concGoodSpecs, StringStartsQ[#File, e] &]}], First];\n\n(* generic stacked-bar panel: xs = bar centres, halfW = half width, both in axis units *)\nstackedBars[recs_, xs_, halfW_, xt_, xLab_, xRange_, yMax_, labels_, ttl_] := Module[{fg, bg, bars, txt},\n  fg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White];\n  bg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", White, GrayLevel[0.12]];\n  bars = MapThread[Function[{d, x},\n     {{slowCol, EdgeForm[Directive[fg, AbsoluteThickness[0.6]]], Rectangle[{x - halfW, 0}, {x + halfW, d[[3]]}]},\n      {fastCol, EdgeForm[Directive[fg, AbsoluteThickness[0.6]]], Rectangle[{x - halfW, d[[3]]}, {x + halfW, d[[3]] + d[[4]]}]}}],\n    {recs, xs}];\n  txt = If[labels === None, {},\n    MapThread[Text[Style[#2, fg, 9], {#3, #1[[3]] + #1[[4]]}, {0, -1.3}] &, {recs, labels, xs}]];\n  Graphics[{bars, txt},\n    Frame -> True, Axes -> False, Background -> bg, FrameStyle -> Directive[fg, AbsoluteThickness[1.1]],\n    FrameTicks -> {{DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[0., yMax, fg], None}, {xt, None}},\n    FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[fg, 11], LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 12, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"],\n    FrameLabel -> {Style[xLab, 12, fg], Style[\"Capacitance (nF)\", 12, fg]},\n    PlotLabel -> Style[ttl, 12, fg, Bold],\n    PlotRange -> {xRange, {0, yMax}}, PlotRangePadding -> None,\n    AspectRatio -> 0.7, ImageSize -> 430]];\n\n(* placeholder panel for electrodes whose files carry no run clock *)\nnoTimePanel[e_] := Module[{fg, bg},\n  fg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White];\n  bg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", White, GrayLevel[0.12]];\n  Graphics[{Text[Style[DCTPlots`ElectrodeName[e] <> \": no acquisition-time stamps in these files\\n(per-spectrum clock only)\", fg, 11], {0, 0}]},\n    Frame -> True, FrameTicks -> None, Background -> bg, FrameStyle -> Directive[fg, AbsoluteThickness[1.1]],\n    PlotRange -> {{-1, 1}, {-1, 1}}, AspectRatio -> 0.7, ImageSize -> 430]];\n\ncapAll = capRecs /@ concElectrodes;\ncapYMax = 1.12 Max[Flatten[#[[All, 3]] + #[[All, 4]] & /@ capAll]];   (* shared y scale *)\n\ncapPanels[e_, recs_] := Module[{fg, xtC, t0, tSpan, hwC, xC},\n  fg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White];\n  xtC = Join[{{barX[0], \"0\", {0, 0.016}, {fg}}},\n    {Log10[#], Superscript[10, Round@Log10[#]], {0, 0.016}, {fg}} & /@ {1., 10., 100., 1000.},\n    {Log10[#], \"\", {0, 0.008}, {fg}} & /@ Select[recs[[All, 1]], !MemberQ[{0., 1., 10., 100., 1000.}, #] &]];\n  xC = barX /@ recs[[All, 1]];\n  hwC = Min[0.09, 0.4 Min[Differences[Sort[xC]]]];   (* equal widths, no overlap of neighbours *)\n  t0 = Min[recs[[All, 2]]]; tSpan = Max[recs[[All, 2]]] - t0;\n  {stackedBars[recs, xC, hwC, xtC, \"[Vancomycin] (\\[Mu]M)\",\n     {barX[0] - 0.35, Log10[1000.] + 0.35}, capYMax, None, DCTPlots`ElectrodeName[e] <> \":  vs concentration\"],\n   If[tSpan < 0.1,   (* < 6 min across the whole set: no real run clock *)\n     noTimePanel[e],\n     stackedBars[recs, recs[[All, 2]] - t0, 0.022 tSpan, DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[0., 1.05 tSpan, fg],\n       \"Time since first spectrum (h)\", {-0.05 tSpan, 1.08 tSpan}, capYMax,\n       (ToString[Round[#]] <> \" \\[Mu]M\") & /@ recs[[All, 1]], DCTPlots`ElectrodeName[e] <> \":  vs acquisition time\"]]}];\n\nLegended[Grid[MapThread[capPanels, {concElectrodes, capAll}], Spacings -> {1, 1}],\n  Placed[SwatchLegend[{fastCol, slowCol}, {\"fast (folded)\", \"slow (unfolded)\"},\n    LabelStyle -> Directive[If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White], 12]], Bottom]]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "ad35107c-a2ae-4b39-ab9f-19e05c68d1bf"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* 5.3.3b  The two fitted circuit parameters against [vancomycin], on the same log x axis\n   as the bars above (0 uM parked at the left, same tick treatment): the solution\n   resistance Rs from the outer Brent loop and the double-layer capacitance C_dl = C0,\n   the fast-limit capacitance of the ladder. One trace per electrode. Neither is a binding\n   observable, so a trend here is a control: Rs should be flat (same cell, same buffer)\n   and C_dl should be flat unless the film itself is changing. Electrodes A1 to A3 were\n   measured at {0, 100, 145, 200, 250} uM only, hence the long segment across the gap. *)\ncircRecs[e_] := SortBy[Table[{N@getLabelUM[r[\"File\"]], r[\"Spec\"][\"Rs\"], 1.*^9 r[\"Spec\"][\"C0\"]},\n  {r, Select[concGoodSpecs, StringStartsQ[#File, e] &]}], First];\ncircAll = circRecs /@ concElectrodes;\n\ncircPanel[col_, yLab_, ttl_] := Module[{fg, bg, xtC, allC, traces, yLo, yHi, pad},\n  fg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White];\n  bg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", White, GrayLevel[0.12]];\n  allC = Union @ Flatten[circAll[[All, All, 1]]];\n  (* same x treatment as the bar chart: 0 uM parked at the left, decade labels, minor ticks *)\n  xtC = Join[{{barX[0], \"0\", {0, 0.016}, {fg}}},\n    {Log10[#], Superscript[10, Round@Log10[#]], {0, 0.016}, {fg}} & /@ {1., 10., 100., 1000.},\n    {Log10[#], \"\", {0, 0.008}, {fg}} & /@ Select[allC, # > 0 && !MemberQ[{1., 10., 100., 1000.}, #] &]];\n  traces = Map[{barX[#[[1]]], #[[col]]} & /@ # &, circAll];\n  {yLo, yHi} = MinMax[Flatten[circAll[[All, All, col]]]];\n  pad = 0.12 (yHi - yLo); yLo = Max[0., yLo - pad]; yHi = yHi + pad;\n  ListLinePlot[traces, Joined -> True, PlotMarkers -> {Automatic, 8},\n    PlotStyle -> (Directive[ColorData[97][#], AbsoluteThickness[1.6]] & /@ Range[Length[circAll]]),\n    PlotTheme -> \"Default\", Frame -> True, Axes -> False, Background -> bg,\n    FrameStyle -> Directive[fg, AbsoluteThickness[1.1]],\n    FrameTicks -> {{DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[yLo, yHi, fg], None}, {xtC, None}},\n    FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[fg, 11], LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 12, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"],\n    FrameLabel -> {Style[\"[Vancomycin] (\\[Mu]M)\", 13, fg], Style[yLab, 13, fg]},\n    PlotLabel -> Style[ttl, 13, Bold, fg],\n    PlotRange -> {{barX[0] - 0.35, Log10[1000.] + 0.35}, {yLo, yHi}}, PlotRangePadding -> None,\n    ImageSize -> 470, AspectRatio -> 0.7]];\n\nLegended[\n  Row[{circPanel[2, Row[{\"Solution resistance \", Subscript[\"R\", \"s\"], \" (\\[CapitalOmega])\"}],\n         \"Solution resistance vs concentration\"], Spacer[12],\n       circPanel[3, Row[{\"Double-layer capacitance \", Subscript[\"C\", \"dl\"], \" (nF)\"}],\n         \"Double-layer capacitance vs concentration\"]}],\n  Placed[LineLegend[ColorData[97] /@ Range[Length[concElectrodes]],\n    DCTPlots`ElectrodeName /@ concElectrodes, LegendLayout -> \"Row\",\n    LabelStyle -> Directive[If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White], 12]], Bottom]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"23243\" data-output-id=\"60\" data-out-n=\"459\" data-sub-idx=\"4\" data-output-format=\"SVG\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"89\" data-sub-start=\"33\" data-sub-end=\"40\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[459]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\\\Users\\\\Bob Lansdorp\\\\Documents\\\\DCT\\\\img\\\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\\\wl_h24aduwkojhs.svg\" width=\"643\" height=\"1068\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_h24aduwkojhs.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* 5.3.3b  The two fitted circuit parameters against [vancomycin], on the same log x axis\n   as the bars above (0 uM parked at the left, same tick treatment): the solution\n   resistance Rs from the outer Brent loop and the double-layer capacitance C_dl = C0,\n   the fast-limit capacitance of the ladder. One trace per electrode. Neither is a binding\n   observable, so a trend here is a control: Rs should be flat (same cell, same buffer)\n   and C_dl should be flat unless the film itself is changing. Electrodes A1 to A3 were\n   measured at {0, 100, 145, 200, 250} uM only, hence the long segment across the gap. *)\ncircRecs[e_] := SortBy[Table[{N@getLabelUM[r[\"File\"]], r[\"Spec\"][\"Rs\"], 1.*^9 r[\"Spec\"][\"C0\"]},\n  {r, Select[concGoodSpecs, StringStartsQ[#File, e] &]}], First];\ncircAll = circRecs /@ concElectrodes;\n\ncircPanel[col_, yLab_, ttl_] := Module[{fg, bg, xtC, allC, traces, yLo, yHi, pad},\n  fg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White];\n  bg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", White, GrayLevel[0.12]];\n  allC = Union @ Flatten[circAll[[All, All, 1]]];\n  (* same x treatment as the bar chart: 0 uM parked at the left, decade labels, minor ticks *)\n  xtC = Join[{{barX[0], \"0\", {0, 0.016}, {fg}}},\n    {Log10[#], Superscript[10, Round@Log10[#]], {0, 0.016}, {fg}} & /@ {1., 10., 100., 1000.},\n    {Log10[#], \"\", {0, 0.008}, {fg}} & /@ Select[allC, # > 0 && !MemberQ[{1., 10., 100., 1000.}, #] &]];\n  traces = Map[{barX[#[[1]]], #[[col]]} & /@ # &, circAll];\n  {yLo, yHi} = MinMax[Flatten[circAll[[All, All, col]]]];\n  pad = 0.12 (yHi - yLo); yLo = Max[0., yLo - pad]; yHi = yHi + pad;\n  ListLinePlot[traces, Joined -> True, PlotMarkers -> {Automatic, 8},\n    PlotStyle -> (Directive[ColorData[97][#], AbsoluteThickness[1.6]] & /@ Range[Length[circAll]]),\n    PlotTheme -> \"Default\", Frame -> True, Axes -> False, Background -> bg,\n    FrameStyle -> Directive[fg, AbsoluteThickness[1.1]],\n    FrameTicks -> {{DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[yLo, yHi, fg], None}, {xtC, None}},\n    FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[fg, 11], LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 12, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"],\n    FrameLabel -> {Style[\"[Vancomycin] (\\[Mu]M)\", 13, fg], Style[yLab, 13, fg]},\n    PlotLabel -> Style[ttl, 13, Bold, fg],\n    PlotRange -> {{barX[0] - 0.35, Log10[1000.] + 0.35}, {yLo, yHi}}, PlotRangePadding -> None,\n    ImageSize -> 470, AspectRatio -> 0.7]];\n\nLegended[\n  Row[{circPanel[2, Row[{\"Solution resistance \", Subscript[\"R\", \"s\"], \" (\\[CapitalOmega])\"}],\n         \"Solution resistance vs concentration\"], Spacer[12],\n       circPanel[3, Row[{\"Double-layer capacitance \", Subscript[\"C\", \"dl\"], \" (nF)\"}],\n         \"Double-layer capacitance vs concentration\"]}],\n  Placed[LineLegend[ColorData[97] /@ Range[Length[concElectrodes]],\n    DCTPlots`ElectrodeName /@ concElectrodes, LegendLayout -> \"Row\",\n    LabelStyle -> Directive[If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White], 12]], Bottom]]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "3e6255c7-1e26-4148-be8e-062471c18d9e"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 5.4 Fraction folded",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Fraction folded vs [vancomycin].\n   k_peak shifts from the unbound population (range 1) to the bound/folded population (range 2).\n   ff = area(range 2) / (area(range 1) + area(range 2)) \\[Dash] naturally 0 to 1. *)\n\nareaWindow[spec_, kLo_, kHi_] := Module[{tau, g, k, logK, n},\n  tau = spec[\"Tau\"]; g = spec[\"g\"]; k = 1./tau; logK = Log10[k]; n = Length[g];\n  If[n < 2, Return[0.]];\n  Total @ Table[If[0.5(k[[j]]+k[[j+1]]) >= kLo && 0.5(k[[j]]+k[[j+1]]) <= kHi,\n    0.5(g[[j]]+g[[j+1]]) Abs[logK[[j+1]]-logK[[j]]], 0.], {j, n-1}]\n];\n\n(* one {conc, ff} list per electrode (concElectrodes = the tags A1..A3 and B1..B3 from the fit cell) *)\nffPerElectrode = Table[\n  Module[{subs, concs, a1, a2, ff},\n    subs  = Select[concGoodSpecs, StringStartsQ[#File, e] &];\n    concs = N @ (getLabelUM /@ subs[[All, \"File\"]]);\n    (* each spectrum integrated over its own gap-centred windows (peakWindows, 4a.6) *)\n    a1    = areaWindow[#Spec, Sequence @@ peakWindows[#Spec][[1]]] & /@ subs;\n    a2    = areaWindow[#Spec, Sequence @@ peakWindows[#Spec][[2]]] & /@ subs;\n    ff    = MapThread[If[#1+#2 > 0., #2/(#1+#2), 0.] &, {a1, a2}];\n    Transpose[{concs, ff}]\n  ],\n  {e, concElectrodes}\n];\n\n(* per-electrode: drop 0 \\[Mu]M for the log-x plots (electrodes have different conc grids) *)\nffPos = Select[#, First[#] > 0 &] & /@ ffPerElectrode;\ncHi   = Max[Flatten[ffPerElectrode[[All, All, 1]]]] * 1.1;\n\ndarkBg  = GrayLevel[0.12];\nfgStyle = Directive[White, AbsoluteThickness[1.1]];\neCols   = Directive[ColorData[97][#], AbsoluteThickness[1.8]] & /@ Range[Length[concElectrodes]];\n\nListLinePlot[ffPos,\n  ScalingFunctions -> {\"Log10\", None},\n  Joined -> False, PlotMarkers -> {Automatic, 10}, PlotStyle -> eCols,\n  FrameTicks -> {{DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[0., 1., White], None}, {DCTPlots`ThemeLogTicks[0.8, cHi, White], None}},\n  FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[White, 12],\n  Frame -> True, Axes -> False, Background -> darkBg, FrameStyle -> fgStyle,\n  LabelStyle -> Directive[White, 14, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"],\n  FrameLabel -> {Style[\"[Vancomycin] (\\[Mu]M)\", 14, White], Style[\"Fraction folded\", 14, White]},\n  PlotRange -> {{0.8, cHi}, {0, 1}},\n  PlotRangePadding -> Scaled[0.04],\n  ImageSize -> 500, AspectRatio -> 0.75,\n  PlotLegends -> Placed[LineLegend[eCols, DCTPlots`ElectrodeName /@ concElectrodes,\n    LabelStyle -> Directive[White, 12], Background -> darkBg,\n    LegendFunction -> (Framed[#, Background->darkBg, FrameStyle->fgStyle]&)], Right]\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"23243\" data-output-id=\"61\" data-out-n=\"467\" data-sub-idx=\"10\" data-output-format=\"SVG\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"91\" data-sub-start=\"33\" data-sub-end=\"47\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[467]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\\\Users\\\\Bob Lansdorp\\\\Documents\\\\DCT\\\\img\\\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\\\wl_1m6o2kn7i355a.svg\" width=\"815\" height=\"520\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_1m6o2kn7i355a.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* Fraction folded vs [vancomycin].\n   k_peak shifts from the unbound population (range 1) to the bound/folded population (range 2).\n   ff = area(range 2) / (area(range 1) + area(range 2)) \\[Dash] naturally 0 to 1. *)\n\nareaWindow[spec_, kLo_, kHi_] := Module[{tau, g, k, logK, n},\n  tau = spec[\"Tau\"]; g = spec[\"g\"]; k = 1./tau; logK = Log10[k]; n = Length[g];\n  If[n < 2, Return[0.]];\n  Total @ Table[If[0.5(k[[j]]+k[[j+1]]) >= kLo && 0.5(k[[j]]+k[[j+1]]) <= kHi,\n    0.5(g[[j]]+g[[j+1]]) Abs[logK[[j+1]]-logK[[j]]], 0.], {j, n-1}]\n];\n\n(* one {conc, ff} list per electrode (concElectrodes = the tags A1..A3 and B1..B3 from the fit cell) *)\nffPerElectrode = Table[\n  Module[{subs, concs, a1, a2, ff},\n    subs  = Select[concGoodSpecs, StringStartsQ[#File, e] &];\n    concs = N @ (getLabelUM /@ subs[[All, \"File\"]]);\n    (* each spectrum integrated over its own gap-centred windows (peakWindows, 4a.6) *)\n    a1    = areaWindow[#Spec, Sequence @@ peakWindows[#Spec][[1]]] & /@ subs;\n    a2    = areaWindow[#Spec, Sequence @@ peakWindows[#Spec][[2]]] & /@ subs;\n    ff    = MapThread[If[#1+#2 > 0., #2/(#1+#2), 0.] &, {a1, a2}];\n    Transpose[{concs, ff}]\n  ],\n  {e, concElectrodes}\n];\n\n(* per-electrode: drop 0 \\[Mu]M for the log-x plots (electrodes have different conc grids) *)\nffPos = Select[#, First[#] > 0 &] & /@ ffPerElectrode;\ncHi   = Max[Flatten[ffPerElectrode[[All, All, 1]]]] * 1.1;\n\ndarkBg  = GrayLevel[0.12];\nfgStyle = Directive[White, AbsoluteThickness[1.1]];\neCols   = Directive[ColorData[97][#], AbsoluteThickness[1.8]] & /@ Range[Length[concElectrodes]];\n\nListLinePlot[ffPos,\n  ScalingFunctions -> {\"Log10\", None},\n  Joined -> False, PlotMarkers -> {Automatic, 10}, PlotStyle -> eCols,\n  FrameTicks -> {{DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[0., 1., White], None}, {DCTPlots`ThemeLogTicks[0.8, cHi, White], None}},\n  FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[White, 12],\n  Frame -> True, Axes -> False, Background -> darkBg, FrameStyle -> fgStyle,\n  LabelStyle -> Directive[White, 14, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"],\n  FrameLabel -> {Style[\"[Vancomycin] (\\[Mu]M)\", 14, White], Style[\"Fraction folded\", 14, White]},\n  PlotRange -> {{0.8, cHi}, {0, 1}},\n  PlotRangePadding -> Scaled[0.04],\n  ImageSize -> 500, AspectRatio -> 0.75,\n  PlotLegends -> Placed[LineLegend[eCols, DCTPlots`ElectrodeName /@ concElectrodes,\n    LabelStyle -> Directive[White, 12], Background -> darkBg,\n    LegendFunction -> (Framed[#, Background->darkBg, FrameStyle->fgStyle]&)], Right]\n]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "1a527cb3-b25d-4942-a031-700da55d6de8"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 5.5 Mean electron-transfer rate per state\nGeometric, g-weighted mean rate <k> of the unfolded (slow, range 1) and folded (fast, range 2) populations vs [vancomycin]. One faint curve per electrode; bold = pooled mean over electrodes. Uses the same kPeakRanges windows as the fraction-folded analysis.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* 5.5  Mean electron-transfer rate of each conformational state vs [vancomycin].\n   Each g(k) splits into the unfolded (slow) and folded (fast) populations using the\n   same kPeakRanges windows as the fraction-folded analysis (range 1 = unfolded,\n   range 2 = folded; see analysis/Biophysics.wl). We report the g-weighted GEOMETRIC\n   mean rate <k> of each population (centroid in log-k), one faint curve per electrode\n   plus the pooled mean over electrodes (bold). *)\n\n(* A state's rate is undefined when that state carries less than 1% of the total\n   capacitance: with almost nothing in the window, the centroid would just report\n   whatever tail happens to be there (e.g. a sliver of the other peak's flank). *)\nwindowGeoMean[spec_, kLo_, kHi_] := Module[{tau, g, k, logk, idx, w},\n  tau = spec[\"Tau\"]; g = spec[\"g\"]; k = 1./tau; logk = Log10[k];\n  idx = Select[Range[Length[g]], k[[#]] >= kLo && k[[#]] <= kHi && g[[#]] > 0 &];\n  If[idx === {} || Total[g[[idx]]] < 0.01 Total[g], Missing[],\n    w = g[[idx]]; 10.^(w.logk[[idx]]/Total[w])]\n];\n\n(* {conc, <k>_unfolded, <k>_folded} per electrode, sorted by concentration *)\nstateRateData = Table[\n  Module[{subs},\n    subs = Select[concGoodSpecs, StringStartsQ[#File, e] &];\n    SortBy[{N@getLabelUM[#File],\n            windowGeoMean[#Spec, Sequence @@ peakWindows[#Spec][[1]]],\n            windowGeoMean[#Spec, Sequence @@ peakWindows[#Spec][[2]]]} & /@ subs, First]\n  ],\n  {e, concElectrodes}\n];\n\nstateXOf[c_] := If[c == 0, 0.3, N[c]];   (* 0 \\[Mu]M baseline at the left of the log axis *)\nfaintU = ({stateXOf[#[[1]]], #[[2]]} & /@ #) & /@ stateRateData;\nfaintF = ({stateXOf[#[[1]]], #[[3]]} & /@ #) & /@ stateRateData;\nbyC    = GroupBy[Flatten[stateRateData, 1], First];\nconcsS = Sort[Keys[byC]];\nboldU  = {stateXOf[#], Mean[DeleteMissing[byC[#][[All, 2]]]]} & /@ concsS;\nboldF  = {stateXOf[#], Mean[DeleteMissing[byC[#][[All, 3]]]]} & /@ concsS;\n\n(* the numbers behind the plot: pooled over electrodes at each concentration, mean +/- SD *)\nmeanSD[v_] := Module[{d = DeleteMissing[v]},\n  If[d === {}, \"undef\", ToString[NumberForm[Mean[d], {4, 1}]] <> If[Length[d] > 1, \" \\[PlusMinus] \" <> ToString[NumberForm[StandardDeviation[d], {3, 1}]], \"\"]]];\nstateRateTable = Framed[Grid[Prepend[\n    Table[{NumberForm[c, {5, 0}], Length[byC[c]], meanSD[byC[c][[All, 2]]], meanSD[byC[c][[All, 3]]]}, {c, concsS}],\n    Style[#, Bold] & /@ {\"[vancomycin] (\\[Mu]M)\", \"n electrodes\",\n      Row[{\"slow \\[LeftAngleBracket]k\\[RightAngleBracket] (\", Superscript[\"s\", -1], \")\"}],\n      Row[{\"fast \\[LeftAngleBracket]k\\[RightAngleBracket] (\", Superscript[\"s\", -1], \")\"}]}],\n  ItemSize -> Full, Alignment -> {{Right, Center, Right, Right}}, Dividers -> {None, {2 -> True}},\n  Spacings -> {2.5, 0.6}, Background -> White,\n  BaseStyle -> {FontFamily -> \"Arial\", FontSize -> 13, FontColor -> Black}],\n  Background -> White, FrameStyle -> GrayLevel[0.75], FrameMargins -> 12, RoundingRadius -> 4];\nPrint[stateRateTable];\n\ncolU = ColorData[\"Rainbow\"][0.08]; colF = ColorData[\"Rainbow\"][0.85];\nnE = Length[concElectrodes];\n\n(* theme-parameterised so the dark notebook view and the white export share one definition *)\nstateRatesPlot[fg_, bg_] := Module[{xt},\n  xt = Join[\n    {{0.3, \"0\", {0, 0.016}, {fg}}},\n    {#, Superscript[10, Round@Log10[#]], {0, 0.016}, {fg}} & /@ {1., 10., 100., 1000.},\n    {#, \"\", {0, 0.008}, {fg}} & /@ Flatten@Table[m 10.^ee, {ee, 0, 2}, {m, {2, 3, 5, 7}}]];\n  ListLogLogPlot[\n    Join[faintU, faintF, {boldU, boldF}],\n    Joined -> True,\n    PlotStyle -> Join[\n      ConstantArray[Directive[colU, Opacity[0.3], AbsoluteThickness[1.]], nE],\n      ConstantArray[Directive[colF, Opacity[0.3], AbsoluteThickness[1.]], nE],\n      {Directive[colU, AbsoluteThickness[3.2]], Directive[colF, AbsoluteThickness[3.2]]}],\n    PlotMarkers -> Join[ConstantArray[{\"\\[FilledCircle]\", 4}, 2 nE],\n      {{\"\\[FilledCircle]\", 12}, {\"\\[FilledSquare]\", 11}}],\n    Frame -> True, Axes -> False, Background -> bg,\n    FrameStyle -> Directive[fg, AbsoluteThickness[1.2]], PlotTheme -> \"Default\",\n    LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 13],\n    FrameTicks -> {{DCTPlots`ThemeLogTicks[30., 420., fg], None}, {xt, None}},\n    FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[fg, 12],\n    FrameLabel -> {Style[\"[Vancomycin] (\\[Mu]M)\", 14, fg],\n      Style[Row[{\"Mean electron-transfer rate, \\[LeftAngleBracket]k\\[RightAngleBracket] (\", Superscript[\"s\", -1], \")\"}], 14, fg]},\n    PlotRange -> {{0.22, 1600}, {28, 440}}, AspectRatio -> 0.62, ImageSize -> 680,\n    Epilog -> {Style[Text[\"Folded (fast)\", Scaled[{0.30, 0.9}]], colF, 14],\n      Style[Text[\"Unfolded (slow)\", Scaled[{0.30, 0.34}]], colU, 14]}]\n];\n\nstateRatesPlot[White, GrayLevel[0.12]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"64\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:14.4em;vertical-align:-6.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:7.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-9.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">[vancomycin] (</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord\">M)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">0.</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">1.</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">10.</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">100.</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">145.</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">178.</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">200.</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">250.</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:1.19em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">316.</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:2.39em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">562.</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:3.59em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">1000.</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:7.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-9.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">n electrodes</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:1.19em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:2.39em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:3.59em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:7.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-9.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">slow </span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span><span class=\"mord\"> (</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05e