     "id": "a7ab336f-a274-4866-b19a-7c9acfed5f44"
    },
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"23243\" data-output-id=\"62\" data-out-n=\"483\" data-sub-idx=\"20\" data-output-format=\"SVG\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"93\" data-sub-start=\"80\" data-sub-end=\"80\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[483]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\\\Users\\\\Bob Lansdorp\\\\Documents\\\\DCT\\\\img\\\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\\\wl_mptfakrvm0eg.svg\" width=\"907\" height=\"584\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_mptfakrvm0eg.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* 5.5  Mean electron-transfer rate of each conformational state vs [vancomycin].\n   Each g(k) splits into the unfolded (slow) and folded (fast) populations using the\n   same kPeakRanges windows as the fraction-folded analysis (range 1 = unfolded,\n   range 2 = folded; see analysis/Biophysics.wl). We report the g-weighted GEOMETRIC\n   mean rate <k> of each population (centroid in log-k), one faint curve per electrode\n   plus the pooled mean over electrodes (bold). *)\n\n(* A state's rate is undefined when that state carries less than 1% of the total\n   capacitance: with almost nothing in the window, the centroid would just report\n   whatever tail happens to be there (e.g. a sliver of the other peak's flank). *)\nwindowGeoMean[spec_, kLo_, kHi_] := Module[{tau, g, k, logk, idx, w},\n  tau = spec[\"Tau\"]; g = spec[\"g\"]; k = 1./tau; logk = Log10[k];\n  idx = Select[Range[Length[g]], k[[#]] >= kLo && k[[#]] <= kHi && g[[#]] > 0 &];\n  If[idx === {} || Total[g[[idx]]] < 0.01 Total[g], Missing[],\n    w = g[[idx]]; 10.^(w.logk[[idx]]/Total[w])]\n];\n\n(* {conc, <k>_unfolded, <k>_folded} per electrode, sorted by concentration *)\nstateRateData = Table[\n  Module[{subs},\n    subs = Select[concGoodSpecs, StringStartsQ[#File, e] &];\n    SortBy[{N@getLabelUM[#File],\n            windowGeoMean[#Spec, Sequence @@ peakWindows[#Spec][[1]]],\n            windowGeoMean[#Spec, Sequence @@ peakWindows[#Spec][[2]]]} & /@ subs, First]\n  ],\n  {e, concElectrodes}\n];\n\nstateXOf[c_] := If[c == 0, 0.3, N[c]];   (* 0 \\[Mu]M baseline at the left of the log axis *)\nfaintU = ({stateXOf[#[[1]]], #[[2]]} & /@ #) & /@ stateRateData;\nfaintF = ({stateXOf[#[[1]]], #[[3]]} & /@ #) & /@ stateRateData;\nbyC    = GroupBy[Flatten[stateRateData, 1], First];\nconcsS = Sort[Keys[byC]];\nboldU  = {stateXOf[#], Mean[DeleteMissing[byC[#][[All, 2]]]]} & /@ concsS;\nboldF  = {stateXOf[#], Mean[DeleteMissing[byC[#][[All, 3]]]]} & /@ concsS;\n\n(* the numbers behind the plot: pooled over electrodes at each concentration, mean +/- SD *)\nmeanSD[v_] := Module[{d = DeleteMissing[v]},\n  If[d === {}, \"undef\", ToString[NumberForm[Mean[d], {4, 1}]] <> If[Length[d] > 1, \" \\[PlusMinus] \" <> ToString[NumberForm[StandardDeviation[d], {3, 1}]], \"\"]]];\nstateRateTable = Framed[Grid[Prepend[\n    Table[{NumberForm[c, {5, 0}], Length[byC[c]], meanSD[byC[c][[All, 2]]], meanSD[byC[c][[All, 3]]]}, {c, concsS}],\n    Style[#, Bold] & /@ {\"[vancomycin] (\\[Mu]M)\", \"n electrodes\",\n      Row[{\"slow \\[LeftAngleBracket]k\\[RightAngleBracket] (\", Superscript[\"s\", -1], \")\"}],\n      Row[{\"fast \\[LeftAngleBracket]k\\[RightAngleBracket] (\", Superscript[\"s\", -1], \")\"}]}],\n  ItemSize -> Full, Alignment -> {{Right, Center, Right, Right}}, Dividers -> {None, {2 -> True}},\n  Spacings -> {2.5, 0.6}, Background -> White,\n  BaseStyle -> {FontFamily -> \"Arial\", FontSize -> 13, FontColor -> Black}],\n  Background -> White, FrameStyle -> GrayLevel[0.75], FrameMargins -> 12, RoundingRadius -> 4];\nPrint[stateRateTable];\n\ncolU = ColorData[\"Rainbow\"][0.08]; colF = ColorData[\"Rainbow\"][0.85];\nnE = Length[concElectrodes];\n\n(* theme-parameterised so the dark notebook view and the white export share one definition *)\nstateRatesPlot[fg_, bg_] := Module[{xt},\n  xt = Join[\n    {{0.3, \"0\", {0, 0.016}, {fg}}},\n    {#, Superscript[10, Round@Log10[#]], {0, 0.016}, {fg}} & /@ {1., 10., 100., 1000.},\n    {#, \"\", {0, 0.008}, {fg}} & /@ Flatten@Table[m 10.^ee, {ee, 0, 2}, {m, {2, 3, 5, 7}}]];\n  ListLogLogPlot[\n    Join[faintU, faintF, {boldU, boldF}],\n    Joined -> True,\n    PlotStyle -> Join[\n      ConstantArray[Directive[colU, Opacity[0.3], AbsoluteThickness[1.]], nE],\n      ConstantArray[Directive[colF, Opacity[0.3], AbsoluteThickness[1.]], nE],\n      {Directive[colU, AbsoluteThickness[3.2]], Directive[colF, AbsoluteThickness[3.2]]}],\n    PlotMarkers -> Join[ConstantArray[{\"\\[FilledCircle]\", 4}, 2 nE],\n      {{\"\\[FilledCircle]\", 12}, {\"\\[FilledSquare]\", 11}}],\n    Frame -> True, Axes -> False, Background -> bg,\n    FrameStyle -> Directive[fg, AbsoluteThickness[1.2]], PlotTheme -> \"Default\",\n    LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 13],\n    FrameTicks -> {{DCTPlots`ThemeLogTicks[30., 420., fg], None}, {xt, None}},\n    FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[fg, 12],\n    FrameLabel -> {Style[\"[Vancomycin] (\\[Mu]M)\", 14, fg],\n      Style[Row[{\"Mean electron-transfer rate, \\[LeftAngleBracket]k\\[RightAngleBracket] (\", Superscript[\"s\", -1], \")\"}], 14, fg]},\n    PlotRange -> {{0.22, 1600}, {28, 440}}, AspectRatio -> 0.62, ImageSize -> 680,\n    Epilog -> {Style[Text[\"Folded (fast)\", Scaled[{0.30, 0.9}]], colF, 14],\n      Style[Text[\"Unfolded (slow)\", Scaled[{0.30, 0.34}]], colU, 14]}]\n];\n\nstateRatesPlot[White, GrayLevel[0.12]]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "68ba657e-1137-4377-b9c6-2a6edbfc0688"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 5a. Biophysical Model Fits\n\nFits the mechanistic kinetic model to fraction-folded vs concentration data pooled across all electrodes.\n\n**3-state model** (U ↔ F ↔ B): all aptamers can fold. Parameters: K_S (structural switching equilibrium), K_D (ligand dissociation constant). Baseline ff at zero ligand is K_S / (1 + K_S).\n\n**4-state model** (U ↔ F ↔ B + NF non-folding): fraction NF is permanently unfolded regardless of ligand. Parameters: K_S, K_D, NF. The 4-state K_D is typically much smaller than the 3-state K_D because NF absorbs the saturation shortfall rather than inflating K_D.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 5a.1 Model fit\nFits the 3-state and 4-state models to the pooled fraction-folded data (all electrodes, **including the 0 µM baseline**, the most discriminating point between the models). The manuscript figure is the linear-concentration plot in 5a.2.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Biophysical model fits \\[Dash] mechanistic 3-state and 4-state kinetic models.\n   Data: {[vancomycin] \\[Mu]M, fraction folded} pooled across ALL electrodes, including\n   the 0 \\[Mu]M baseline. The zero-ligand point is the most discriminating between the two\n   models (it pins the 4-state NF plateau), so it stays in the fit. The figure for the\n   manuscript is the linear-concentration plot in 5a.2. *)\n\n(* --- model equations --- *)\nPrint[Style[\"3-state model  (U \\[LeftRightArrow] F \\[LeftRightArrow] B)\", Bold, 13]];\nPrint[Row[{\"  \", Subscript[\"f\", \"f\"], \" = \", DCTBiophysics`$FF3State}]];\nPrint[Style[\"4-state model  (U \\[LeftRightArrow] F \\[LeftRightArrow] B,  NF non-folding)\", Bold, 13]];\nPrint[Row[{\"  \", Subscript[\"f\", \"f\"], \" = \", DCTBiophysics`$FF4State}]];\nPrint[\"\"];\n\n(* fit ALL data, including the 0 \\[Mu]M baseline (FitFoldedFraction fits in linear C, so C = 0 is well-defined) *)\nallPts = Flatten[ffPerElectrode, 1];\n\nfitResult = DCTBiophysics`FitFoldedFraction[allPts];\n\n(* --- fit parameters --- *)\nModule[{p3 = fitResult[\"Model3\"], p4 = fitResult[\"Model4\"]},\n  Print[Style[\"3-state model\", Bold, 13]];\n  Print[Row[{\"  \", Subscript[\"K\", \"S\"], \" = \", NumberForm[p3[\"KS\"], {4, 3}],\n             \"     \", Subscript[\"K\", \"D\"], \" = \", NumberForm[p3[\"KD\"], {6, 1}], \" \\[Mu]M\"}]];\n  Print[Style[\"4-state model\", Bold, 13]];\n  Print[Row[{\"  \", Subscript[\"K\", \"S\"], \" = \", NumberForm[p4[\"KS\"], {4, 3}],\n             \"     \", Subscript[\"K\", \"D\"], \" = \", NumberForm[p4[\"KD\"], {6, 1}], \" \\[Mu]M\",\n             \"     NF = \", NumberForm[p4[\"NF\"], {3, 2}]}]]\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
