   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 7.3 Weighting exponent: spectra and fast-mode capacitive fraction\nThree values of the weighting exponent p in w = |Y|^p, in order of increasing |p|: 0 (unweighted), the derived baseline, -1 (Poisson-like noise). The column of panels shows the DCT spectra of the Electrode B1 concentration series, one panel per p on a shared scale. Below them, all three cases share a single plot of the fast-mode capacitive fraction against [vancomycin], pooled over the six electrodes.\n\nThe baseline and p = -1 lie almost on top of each other, which is why the elasticity for this parameter is modest. At p = 0 the fit is dominated by the high-frequency end, the slow population collapses and the fraction runs to ~0.98 at saturation. Publication copies (white background, PDF and 300 dpi PNG) are written to `data/figures` as `weighting_gK` and `weighting_ff`. Table 7.4b, after 7.4, gives the numbers, including the midpoint rate k_mid that separates the two modes.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* 7.3  Weighting exponent p in w = |Y|^p: a single column of DCT spectra, one panel per p\n   (Electrode B1 concentration series), and one combined plot of the fast-mode capacitive\n   fraction vs [vancomycin] pooled over the six electrodes, all three cases overlaid.\n   Rows/curves run in order of increasing |p|: 0 (unweighted), the derived baseline,\n   -1 (Poisson-like). Publication (white) copies of both are written to data/figures. *)\n\n(* refit the Electrode B1 concentration series at one weighting exponent *)\nsensGKCase[wp_] := Module[{files, series = seriesOfDir[concentrationDir]},\n  files = SortBy[Select[FileNames[\"*.txt\", concentrationDir], concElec[#] == \"1\" &], concUM];\n  Select[Table[<|\"File\" -> concLabelOff[f, series],\n      \"Spec\" -> Quiet @ Check[DCT`DCTSpectrum[f,\n          \"LambdaND\" -> lambdaND, \"FMinUse\" -> fMinHz, \"FMaxUse\" -> fMaxHz,\n          \"WeightPower\" -> wp, \"BinsPerDecade\" -> binsPerDecade,\n          \"TauMinFactor\" -> tauMinFactor, \"TauMaxFactor\" -> tauMaxFactor], $Failed]|>,\n    {f, files}], AssociationQ[#Spec] &]];\n\ngkShowP = {0., -1.};\ngkBase  = Select[concGoodSpecs, StringStartsQ[#File, \"B1\"] &];\ngkByP   = AssociationMap[sensGKCase, gkShowP];   (* one refit series per exponent *)\n\nffByP = Association[(#[\"X\"] -> #[\"Curve\"]) & /@ casesWP];   (* pooled ff(C) from the 7.2 sweep *)\nffRef = baseCase[\"Curve\"];\n\npLbl[p_] := \"p = \" <> If[p == Round[p], ToString[Round[p]], ToString[p]];\nbaseLbl  = \"baseline  (p = \" <> ToString[NumberForm[weightPower, {4, 3}]] <> \")\";\npCases   = {{pLbl[0.] <> \"  (unweighted)\", gkByP[0.], ffByP[0.], RGBColor[0.90, 0.45, 0.10]},\n            {baseLbl, gkBase, ffRef, RGBColor[0.20, 0.45, 0.85]},\n            {pLbl[-1.] <> \"  (Poisson-like)\", gkByP[-1.], ffByP[-1.], RGBColor[0.15, 0.65, 0.35]}};\n\ngkYMax = 1.1 Max[1*^9 Flatten[Join[gkBase[[All, \"Spec\", \"g\"]], Flatten[Values[gkByP], 1][[All, \"Spec\", \"g\"]]]]];\n{gkKLo, gkKHi} = MinMax[1./Flatten[gkBase[[All, \"Spec\", \"Tau\"]]]];\nffCMax = 1.03 Max[ffRef[[All, 1]]];\n\n(* one spectra panel. Shared y scale AND shared ticks, since PlotGK would otherwise build\n   ticks from each panel's own maximum. *)\ngkPanel[recs_, ttl_] := With[{fg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White]},\n  DCTPlots`PlotGK[recs, Automatic, \"GScale\" -> 1*^9, ImageSize -> 540, PlotLegends -> None,\n    PlotRange -> {All, {-0.04 gkYMax, gkYMax}},\n    FrameTicks -> {{DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[0., gkYMax, fg], None}, {DCTPlots`ThemeLogTicks[gkKLo, gkKHi, fg], None}},\n    PlotLabel -> Style[ttl, 14, Bold, fg]]];\n\ngkFigure[] := With[{fg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White]},\n  Legended[Column[gkPanel[#[[2]], #[[1]]] & /@ pCases, Spacings -> 0.6, Alignment -> Center],\n    Placed[LineLegend[Table[ColorData[\"Rainbow\"][u], {u, 0.05, 0.95, 0.9/Max[Length[gkBase] - 1, 1]}],\n      StringTrim[StringDrop[#File, 2]] & /@ gkBase, LegendLayout -> \"Row\",\n      LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 12]], Bottom]]];\n\n(* all three cases in one fast-mode capacitive fraction plot *)\nffFigure[] := Module[{fg, bg},\n  fg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White];\n  bg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", White, GrayLevel[0.12]];\n  ListLinePlot[pCases[[All, 3]], Joined -> True, PlotMarkers -> {Automatic, 9},\n    PlotStyle -> (Directive[#, AbsoluteThickness[1.8]] & /@ pCases[[All, 4]]),\n    PlotTheme -> \"Default\", Frame -> True, Axes -> False, Background -> bg,\n    FrameStyle -> Directive[fg, AbsoluteThickness[1.1]],\n    FrameTicks -> {{DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[0., 1., fg], None}, {DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[0., ffCMax, fg], None}},\n    FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[fg, 12], LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 13, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"],\n    FrameLabel -> {Style[\"[Vancomycin] (\\[Mu]M)\", 14, fg], Style[\"Fast-mode capacitive fraction\", 14, fg]},\n    PlotRange -> {{0, ffCMax}, {0, 1}}, PlotRangePadding -> {Scaled[0.03], None},\n    PlotLegends -> Placed[LineLegend[pCases[[All, 4]], pCases[[All, 1]],\n      LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 12]], {0.72, 0.28}],\n    ImageSize -> 560, AspectRatio -> 0.7]];\n\n(* publication (white) copies for the manuscript *)\nfigDirW = FileNameJoin[{dctRoot, \"data\", \"figures\"}];\nIf[!DirectoryQ[figDirW], CreateDirectory[figDirW]];\nBlock[{DCTPlots`$DCTTheme = \"Publication\"},\n  Export[FileNameJoin[{figDirW, \"weighting_gK.pdf\"}], gkFigure[]];\n  Export[FileNameJoin[{figDirW, \"weighting_gK.png\"}], gkFigure[], ImageResolution -> 300];\n  Export[FileNameJoin[{figDirW, \"weighting_ff.pdf\"}], ffFigure[]];\n  Export[FileNameJoin[{figDirW, \"weighting_ff.png\"}], ffFigure[], ImageResolution -> 300]];\nPrint[Style[\"\\[Checkmark] weighting_gK and weighting_ff exported (PDF + 300 dpi PNG, white background) to \" <> figDirW, Italic]];\n\nColumn[{gkFigure[], ffFigure[]}, Alignment -> Center, Spacings -> 1.2]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"65\" data-latex-b64=\"XG1hdGhpdHtcdGV4dHvinJMgd2VpZ2h0aW5nXF9nSyBhbmQgd2VpZ2h0aW5nXF9mZiBleHBvcnRlZCAoUERGICsgMzAwIGRwaSBQTkcsIHdoaXRlIGJhY2tncm91bmQpIHRvIGM6XFxVc2Vyc1xcQm9iIExhbnNkb3JwXFxEb2N1bWVudHNcXERDVFxcZGF0YVxcZmlndXJlc319\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">✓ weighting_gK and weighting_ff exported (PDF + 300 dpi PNG, white background) to c:</span><span class=\"mspace newline\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Users</span><span class=\"mspace newline\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Bob Lansdorp</span><span class=\"mspace newline\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Documents</span><span class=\"mspace newline\"></span><span class=\"mord\">DCT</span><span class=\"mspace newline\"></span><span class=\"mord\">data</span><span class=\"mspace newline\"></span><span class=\"mord\">figures</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
