     "id": "d0e98924-f612-45c7-8635-20a3adcbd9af"
    },
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"64\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">All </span></span><span class=\"mord mathit\">39</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> spectra: Rs fitted median </span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">199.9</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> Ω (</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">157.5</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> to </span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">290.0</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">). median |Z| misfit </span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">1.50</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">% baseline vs </span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">0.46</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">% at Rs = 0. median capacitance above 500 /s </span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">0.0</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">% baseline vs </span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">32.9</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">% at Rs = 0.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: [formula]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "fe1af578-ffe1-441e-8c95-432df40dee4e"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 8.2 The spectra side by side\nThe Electrode B1 concentration series inverted both ways. The top row is on the Rs = 0 scale, the bottom row is zoomed to the baseline scale. With Rs = 0 the ladder has to generate the extra real part that the series resistor contributes to Y = 1/Z. Relaxations at the top of the tau grid do exactly that: for ωτ ≪ 1 an element contributes Re[Y] = gΔω²τ, the same ω² dependence as a series resistance, so the inversion piles capacitance onto the fastest bins (and, to a lesser extent, onto the slowest). That population is an artefact of the missing Rs, it sits outside the measured band, and it is what corrupts the two physical peaks: they broaden, the gap between them fills in, and the slow peak loses amplitude.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* 8.2  g(k) for the Electrode B1 series, baseline (Rs fitted) next to Rs = 0.\n   Top row: both panels on the scale of the Rs = 0 fit, which is dominated by the spike\n   the ladder puts at the fast edge of the tau grid to stand in for the missing series\n   resistor. Bottom row: the same two fits zoomed to the baseline scale, where the\n   interfacial structure is readable. Shared ticks within each row. *)\nrsZeroE1 = SortBy[Select[rsZeroRecs, #Elec === \"B1\" &], #Conc &];\nrsZeroGK = <|\"File\" -> \"B1 \" <> ToString[Round[#Conc]] <> \" \\[Mu]M\", \"Spec\" -> #Spec|> & /@ rsZeroE1;\n\nrsMaxBase = 1.1 Max[1*^9 Flatten[gkBase[[All, \"Spec\", \"g\"]]]];\nrsMaxZero = 1.1 Max[1*^9 Flatten[rsZeroGK[[All, \"Spec\", \"g\"]]]];\n{rsKLo, rsKHi} = MinMax[1./Flatten[gkBase[[All, \"Spec\", \"Tau\"]]]];\n\nrsPanel[recs_, ttl_, yMax_] := With[{fg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White]},\n  DCTPlots`PlotGK[recs, Automatic, \"GScale\" -> 1*^9, ImageSize -> 470, PlotLegends -> None,\n    PlotRange -> {All, {-0.04 yMax, yMax}},\n    FrameTicks -> {{DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[0., yMax, fg], None}, {DCTPlots`ThemeLogTicks[rsKLo, rsKHi, fg], None}},\n    PlotLabel -> Style[ttl, 13, Bold, fg]]];\n\nLegended[\n  Grid[{{rsPanel[gkBase, \"baseline  (Rs fitted)\", rsMaxZero],\n         rsPanel[rsZeroGK, \"Rs = 0  (neglected)\", rsMaxZero]},\n        {rsPanel[gkBase, \"baseline, zoom\", rsMaxBase],\n         rsPanel[rsZeroGK, \"Rs = 0, same zoom (edge spike off scale)\", rsMaxBase]}},\n    Spacings -> {1, 1}],\n  Placed[LineLegend[Table[ColorData[\"Rainbow\"][u], {u, 0.05, 0.95, 0.9/Max[Length[gkBase] - 1, 1]}],\n    StringTrim[StringDrop[#File, 2]] & /@ gkBase,\n    LabelStyle -> Directive[If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White], 12]], Bottom]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"23243\" data-output-id=\"68\" data-out-n=\"639\" data-sub-idx=\"7\" data-output-format=\"SVG\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"122\" data-sub-start=\"18\" data-sub-end=\"26\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[639]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\\\Users\\\\Bob Lansdorp\\\\Documents\\\\DCT\\\\img\\\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\\\wl_wrua4xg8duul.svg\" width=\"1271\" height=\"1156\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_wrua4xg8duul.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* 8.2  g(k) for the Electrode B1 series, baseline (Rs fitted) next to Rs = 0.\n   Top row: both panels on the scale of the Rs = 0 fit, which is dominated by the spike\n   the ladder puts at the fast edge of the tau grid to stand in for the missing series\n   resistor. Bottom row: the same two fits zoomed to the baseline scale, where the\n   interfacial structure is readable. Shared ticks within each row. *)\nrsZeroE1 = SortBy[Select[rsZeroRecs, #Elec === \"B1\" &], #Conc &];\nrsZeroGK = <|\"File\" -> \"B1 \" <> ToString[Round[#Conc]] <> \" \\[Mu]M\", \"Spec\" -> #Spec|> & /@ rsZeroE1;\n\nrsMaxBase = 1.1 Max[1*^9 Flatten[gkBase[[All, \"Spec\", \"g\"]]]];\nrsMaxZero = 1.1 Max[1*^9 Flatten[rsZeroGK[[All, \"Spec\", \"g\"]]]];\n{rsKLo, rsKHi} = MinMax[1./Flatten[gkBase[[All, \"Spec\", \"Tau\"]]]];\n\nrsPanel[recs_, ttl_, yMax_] := With[{fg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White]},\n  DCTPlots`PlotGK[recs, Automatic, \"GScale\" -> 1*^9, ImageSize -> 470, PlotLegends -> None,\n    PlotRange -> {All, {-0.04 yMax, yMax}},\n    FrameTicks -> {{DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[0., yMax, fg], None}, {DCTPlots`ThemeLogTicks[rsKLo, rsKHi, fg], None}},\n    PlotLabel -> Style[ttl, 13, Bold, fg]]];\n\nLegended[\n  Grid[{{rsPanel[gkBase, \"baseline  (Rs fitted)\", rsMaxZero],\n         rsPanel[rsZeroGK, \"Rs = 0  (neglected)\", rsMaxZero]},\n        {rsPanel[gkBase, \"baseline, zoom\", rsMaxBase],\n         rsPanel[rsZeroGK, \"Rs = 0, same zoom (edge spike off scale)\", rsMaxBase]}},\n    Spacings -> {1, 1}],\n  Placed[LineLegend[Table[ColorData[\"Rainbow\"][u], {u, 0.05, 0.95, 0.9/Max[Length[gkBase] - 1, 1]}],\n    StringTrim[StringDrop[#File, 2]] & /@ gkBase,\n    LabelStyle -> Directive[If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White], 12]], Bottom]]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "febd1f05-5bf4-4e8d-b7b2-657c913c7351"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 8.3 Effect on the folded fraction\nThe pooled folded fraction against [vancomycin], mean over the six electrodes, fitted both ways. This is the quantity the biophysical model in section 5a is fitted to, so it is the one that matters for the manuscript's conclusions.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* 8.3  Pooled folded fraction vs [vancomycin]: baseline against Rs = 0, all electrodes.\n   Curves are matched on concentration (not on position) so the difference column is\n   always like for like. *)\nrsFFCurve[recs_] := SortBy[KeyValueMap[{#1, Mean[#2]} &,\n  GroupBy[{N[#Conc], sensFF[#Spec]} & /@ recs, First -> Last]], First];\n\nbaseRecsAll   = <|\"Conc\" -> Last[#], \"Spec\" -> baseByKey[#]|> & /@ Keys[baseByKey];\nffBaseCurve   = rsFFCurve[baseRecsAll];\nffRsZeroCurve = rsFFCurve[rsZeroRecs];\n\nModule[{b = Association[Rule @@@ ffBaseCurve], z = Association[Rule @@@ ffRsZeroCurve], ks},\n  ks = Sort @ Intersection[Keys[b], Keys[z]];\n  Print[Grid[Prepend[\n     Table[{NumberForm[c, {4, 0}], NumberForm[b[c], {4, 3}], NumberForm[z[c], {4, 3}],\n            NumberForm[z[c] - b[c], {4, 3}]}, {c, ks}],\n     Style[#, Bold] & /@ {\"[Vanco] (\\[Mu]M)\", \"ff baseline\", \"ff Rs=0\", \"difference\"}],\n    Frame -> All, Alignment -> {{Right}}, Spacings -> {2, 0.6}]]];\n\nModule[{fg, bg, cMax},\n  fg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White];\n  bg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", White, GrayLevel[0.12]];\n  cMax = 1.03 Max[ffBaseCurve[[All, 1]]];\n  ListLinePlot[{ffBaseCurve, ffRsZeroCurve}, Joined -> True, PlotMarkers -> {Automatic, 9},\n    PlotStyle -> {Directive[RGBColor[0.20, 0.45, 0.85], AbsoluteThickness[1.8]],\n                  Directive[RGBColor[0.85, 0.25, 0.20], AbsoluteThickness[1.8], Dashed]},\n    PlotTheme -> \"Default\", Frame -> True, Axes -> False, Background -> bg,\n    FrameStyle -> Directive[fg, AbsoluteThickness[1.1]],\n    FrameTicks -> {{DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[0., 1., fg], None}, {DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[0., cMax, fg], None}},\n    FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[fg, 12], LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 13, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"],\n    FrameLabel -> {Style[\"[Vancomycin] (\\[Mu]M)\", 14, fg], Style[\"Fraction folded\", 14, fg]},\n    PlotRange -> {{0, cMax}, {0, 1}}, PlotRangePadding -> {Scaled[0.03], None},\n    PlotLegends -> Placed[LineLegend[{RGBColor[0.20, 0.45, 0.85], RGBColor[0.85, 0.25, 0.20]},\n      {\"baseline (Rs fitted)\", \"Rs = 0\"}, LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 12]], {0.72, 0.35}],\n    ImageSize -> 560, AspectRatio -> 0.7]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"64\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:14.44em;vertical-align:-6.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:7.49em;\"><span style=\"top:-9.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:9.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:14.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-6.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:7.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-9.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">[Vanco] (</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord\">M)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">0.</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">1.</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">10.</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">100.</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">145.</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">178.</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">200.</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">250.</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:1.19em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">316.</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:2.39em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">562.</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:3.59em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">1000.</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:14.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-6.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:7.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-9.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ff baseline</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style