   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 9.2 The parallel-only model\nNow the series resistance is dropped entirely and only the parallel resistor is available (rs = 0, Gp free). This is the direct answer to the question: can a resistor across the interface do the job of the one in series with it? Rp is the fitted parallel resistance, the misfit is the relative |Z| residual as in 8.1, and the last column is the share of capacitance pushed above 500 /s, i.e. outside the measured band.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* 9.2  Parallel-only refits (rs = 0, Gp free) of every concentration spectrum. *)\nparRecs = Flatten[Table[\n  If[!StringQ[d[[1]]] || !DirectoryQ[d[[1]]], {},\n    Table[Module[{spec = parallelFit[f, 0.]},\n      If[AssociationQ[spec] && TrueQ[spec[\"OK\"]],\n        <|\"Elec\" -> concTag[f, d[[2]]],\n          \"Conc\" -> N[concUM[f]], \"Spec\" -> spec|>, Nothing]],\n      {f, SortBy[FileNames[\"*.txt\", d[[1]]], {concElec[#], concUM[#]} &]}]],\n  {d, {{concentrationDir, seriesOfDir[concentrationDir]}, {concentrationDir2, seriesOfDir[concentrationDir2]}}}], 1];\nparByKey = Association[({#Elec, N[#Conc]} -> #Spec) & /@ parRecs];\n\nfmtRp[gp_] := If[gp <= 0., \"infinite\", NumberForm[1./(1000. gp), {5, 1}]];\n\nparTable = Module[{keys},\n  keys = SortBy[Select[Keys[parByKey], First[#] === \"B1\" &], Last];\n  Grid[Prepend[\n    Table[Module[{b = baseByKey[k], p = parByKey[k], z = rsZeroByKey[k]},\n      {NumberForm[Last[k], {4, 0}], fmtRp[p[\"Gp\"]],\n       NumberForm[100 relZ[b], {3, 2}], NumberForm[100 relZ[z], {3, 2}], NumberForm[100 relZ[p], {3, 2}],\n       NumberForm[sensFF[b], {4, 3}], NumberForm[sensFF[p], {4, 3}],\n       fmtK[slowK[b]], fmtK[slowK[p]], fmtK[fastK[b]], fmtK[fastK[p]],\n       NumberForm[100 edgeFrac[p], {3, 1}]}], {k, keys}],\n    Style[#, Bold] & /@ {\"[Vanco]\\n(\\[Mu]M)\", \"Rp fitted\\n(k\\[CapitalOmega])\", \"misfit %\\nbase\", \"misfit %\\nRs=0\",\n      \"misfit %\\nparallel\", \"ff\\nbase\", \"ff\\nparallel\", \"slow \\[LeftAngleBracket]k\\[RightAngleBracket]\\nbase\",\n      \"slow \\[LeftAngleBracket]k\\[RightAngleBracket]\\nparallel\", \"fast \\[LeftAngleBracket]k\\[RightAngleBracket]\\nbase\",\n      \"fast \\[LeftAngleBracket]k\\[RightAngleBracket]\\nparallel\", \"C above\\n500 /s (%)\"}],\n   Frame -> All, Alignment -> {{Right}}, Spacings -> {1.1, 0.5},\n   BaseStyle -> {FontFamily -> \"Arial\", FontSize -> 10}]];\n\nPrint[Style[\"Electrode B1: baseline (series Rs) vs parallel-only (Rp)\", Bold, 13]];\nPrint[parTable];\nPrint[Style[Row[{\"All \", Length[parRecs], \" spectra:  Rp median \",\n  NumberForm[Median[1./(1000. Select[#[\"Gp\"] & /@ Values[parByKey], # > 0. &])], {5, 1}],\n  \" k\\[CapitalOmega] (fitted at exactly zero conductance in \",\n  Count[#[\"Gp\"] & /@ Values[parByKey], 0.], \" of them).   median |Z| misfit \",\n  NumberForm[100 Median[relZ /@ Values[baseByKey]], {3, 2}], \"% baseline vs \",\n  NumberForm[100 Median[relZ /@ Values[parByKey]], {3, 2}], \"% parallel.   median capacitance above 500 /s \",\n  NumberForm[100 Median[edgeFrac /@ Values[baseByKey]], {3, 1}], \"% baseline vs \",\n  NumberForm[100 Median[edgeFrac /@ Values[parByKey]], {3, 1}], \"% parallel.\"}], Italic]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
