  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 9.3 Spectra and fast-mode capacitive fraction, all three models\nThe Electrode B1 series under the baseline (series Rs), the parallel-only model, and the Rs = 0 model of section 8, on one shared scale (a, b, c), with the pooled fast-mode capacitive fraction underneath. The parallel and Rs = 0 curves sit on top of each other: the fitted Rp is megaohms, so the parallel branch carries almost no current and the ladder is left to absorb the missing series resistance exactly as it did in section 8.\n\nPublication copies (white background, PDF and 300 dpi PNG) are written to `data/figures` as `parallel_gK` and `parallel_ff`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* 9.3  Baseline vs parallel-only vs Rs = 0: spectra (Electrode B1) and the pooled\n   fast-mode capacitive fraction. Publication (white) copies of both are written to\n   data/figures as parallel_gK and parallel_ff, alongside the notebook versions.\n   The three spectra panels go in a one-row Grid, not a Row: a Row wraps to the page\n   width when rasterised at 300 dpi and the panels end up stacked. *)\nparE1 = SortBy[Select[parRecs, #Elec === \"B1\" &], #Conc &];\nparGK = <|\"File\" -> \"B1 \" <> ToString[Round[#Conc]] <> \" \\[Mu]M\", \"Spec\" -> #Spec|> & /@ parE1;\n\nparYMax = 1.1 Max[1*^9 Flatten[gkBase[[All, \"Spec\", \"g\"]]]];   (* baseline scale: the artefact runs off it *)\nparPanel[recs_, tag_, ttl_] := With[{fg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White]},\n  DCTPlots`PlotGK[recs, Automatic, \"GScale\" -> 1*^9, ImageSize -> 400, AspectRatio -> 0.8,\n    PlotLegends -> None, PlotRange -> {All, {-0.04 parYMax, parYMax}},\n    FrameTicks -> {{DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[0., parYMax, fg], None}, {DCTPlots`ThemeLogTicks[rsKLo, rsKHi, fg], None}},\n    PlotLabel -> Style[ttl, 13, Bold, fg],\n    Epilog -> {Text[Style[tag, 15, Bold, fg], Scaled[{0.04, 0.93}], {-1, 1}]}]];\n\nffParCurve = rsFFCurve[parRecs];\n\nparGKFigure[] := With[{fg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White]},\n  Legended[\n    Grid[{{parPanel[gkBase, \"a\", \"baseline (series Rs)\"],\n           parPanel[parGK, \"b\", \"parallel Rp only\"],\n           parPanel[rsZeroGK, \"c\", \"Rs = 0\"]}}, Spacings -> {1, 0}],\n    Placed[LineLegend[Table[ColorData[\"Rainbow\"][u], {u, 0.05, 0.95, 0.9/Max[Length[gkBase] - 1, 1]}],\n      StringTrim[StringDrop[#File, 2]] & /@ gkBase, LegendLayout -> \"Row\",\n      LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 12]], Bottom]]];\n\nparFFPlot[] := Module[{fg, bg, cMax},\n  fg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White];\n  bg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", White, GrayLevel[0.12]];\n  cMax = 1.03 Max[ffBaseCurve[[All, 1]]];\n  ListLinePlot[{ffBaseCurve, ffParCurve, ffRsZeroCurve}, Joined -> True, PlotMarkers -> {Automatic, 9},\n    PlotStyle -> {Directive[RGBColor[0.20, 0.45, 0.85], AbsoluteThickness[1.8]],\n                  Directive[RGBColor[0.15, 0.65, 0.35], AbsoluteThickness[1.8]],\n                  Directive[RGBColor[0.85, 0.25, 0.20], AbsoluteThickness[1.8], Dashed]},\n    PlotTheme -> \"Default\", Frame -> True, Axes -> False, Background -> bg,\n    FrameStyle -> Directive[fg, AbsoluteThickness[1.1]],\n    FrameTicks -> {{DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[0., 1., fg], None}, {DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[0., cMax, fg], None}},\n    FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[fg, 12], LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 13, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"],\n    FrameLabel -> {Style[\"[Vancomycin] (\\[Mu]M)\", 14, fg], Style[\"Fast-mode capacitive fraction\", 14, fg]},\n    PlotRange -> {{0, cMax}, {0, 1}}, PlotRangePadding -> {Scaled[0.03], None},\n    PlotLegends -> Placed[LineLegend[{RGBColor[0.20, 0.45, 0.85], RGBColor[0.15, 0.65, 0.35], RGBColor[0.85, 0.25, 0.20]},\n      {\"baseline (series Rs)\", \"parallel Rp only\", \"Rs = 0\"}, LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 12]], {0.74, 0.3}],\n    ImageSize -> 560, AspectRatio -> 0.7]];\n\n(* publication (white) copies for the manuscript *)\nfigDirW = FileNameJoin[{dctRoot, \"data\", \"figures\"}];\nIf[!DirectoryQ[figDirW], CreateDirectory[figDirW]];\nBlock[{DCTPlots`$DCTTheme = \"Publication\"},\n  Export[FileNameJoin[{figDirW, \"parallel_gK.pdf\"}], parGKFigure[]];\n  Export[FileNameJoin[{figDirW, \"parallel_gK.png\"}], parGKFigure[], ImageResolution -> 300];\n  Export[FileNameJoin[{figDirW, \"parallel_ff.pdf\"}], parFFPlot[]];\n  Export[FileNameJoin[{figDirW, \"parallel_ff.png\"}], parFFPlot[], ImageResolution -> 300]];\nPrint[Style[\"\\[Checkmark] parallel_gK and parallel_ff exported (PDF + 300 dpi PNG, white background) to \" <> figDirW, Italic]];\n\nColumn[{parGKFigure[], parFFPlot[]}, Alignment -> Center, Spacings -> 1]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"64\" data-latex-b64=\"XG1hdGhpdHtcdGV4dHvinJMgcGFyYWxsZWxcX2dLIGFuZCBwYXJhbGxlbFxfZmYgZXhwb3J0ZWQgKFBERiArIDMwMCBkcGkgUE5HLCB3aGl0ZSBiYWNrZ3JvdW5kKSB0byBjOlxcVXNlcnNcXEJvYiBMYW5zZG9ycFxcRG9jdW1lbnRzXFxEQ1RcXGRhdGFcXGZpZ3VyZXN9fQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">✓ parallel_gK and parallel_ff exported (PDF + 300 dpi PNG, white background) to c:</span><span class=\"mspace newline\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Users</span><span class=\"mspace newline\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Bob Lansdorp</span><span class=\"mspace newline\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Documents</span><span class=\"mspace newline\"></span><span class=\"mord\">DCT</span><span class=\"mspace newline\"></span><span class=\"mord\">data</span><span class=\"mspace newline\"></span><span class=\"mord\">figures</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
